Created On    : 31-Oct-2008 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : SETUP002: this is quite a huge revamp
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 
		- we now build an ear according to the j2ee standards (classloading)
		  because of the ear:
		  - deployment was changed
		  - jndi lookup is different
		  - some container-properties were changed:
		    - conf/jboss-service.xml: CatchSystemOut=false
		          (otherwise we can't see the logging in console)
		    - conf/jboss-web.deployer/META-INF/jboss-service.xml: UseJBossWebLoader=true
		          this way, the war can access shared classes (jcan-log, etc.)
		  - property loading service fir web tier added
