Description   : 
		- introduced LogonBusinessException: exceptions of this type automatically will contain an error id
		- MessageUtils added: this unifies message handling in forms and actions. use the same mechano from both places
		- new message handling ensures that the screen always shows an error id, which can be associated with
		  the same error id in the log.
		- LogonBusinessException may (and should) contain a 'Reason'. The Reson contains a litdict message key
