Created On    : 19-Nov-2008 / cosmin
ADN Bugzilla  : ADN37092
ADN Change ID : ORDERMGR001: initial commit of Dispokarte
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Implementation issues:
					- EJB Services/Persistence: 
						- What different Sevices (Session beans) are we to define, My choice 
						  was to differentiate between the kind of methods the interface provides
						  (Similar functionality in the same Bean -> 
								DropdownSearchServiceBean.java
								EntityAccessServiceBean.java
								ReferenceDataServiceBean.java)
						  Not sure this is the right choice.
						- Added merge function to BaseDao. Not sure why it was left out, for 
						  me it's central in the interaction model.
					- Resources:
						- All needed resources are in the ordermgr-web application.
						  They should be split -> part sholould go to common-web. Special issues
						  		- LitDict.properties: JBoss shared classloader creates aliasing,
						  		  The obviuos solution would be to move the file to common-web,
						  		  problem is that it contains some texts (Mask labels) which are 
						  		  clearly application specific. Maybe the application subproject 
						  		  should merge a litdict file from all application litdicts
						  		  (the keys would have to be prefixed)
						  		- css, images: they should be copied to application.war
						  		  from common-web + specific application, in that order 
						  		  (allow overwriting).
					- AJAX: 
						- 3 use cases implemented:
							- Popups : Implemented as complete Struts actions (EntryAction, 
									   Action, Form) with special JSP that render just parts 
									   of the page (no header and body tags)
									   -> e.g. ordermgr/web/actions/SilobelegungEntryAction.java & co.
							- Updatable content parts :
										Same implementation as popups as they are connected ->
										Popup submit triggers content update.
							- Search Dropdown: DWR implementation aborted because of problem 
										in ExtJS DWR Proxy.
										Implemented as Struts action with FlexJSON output. Looks
										good and similarly easy to implement as DWR.
										Do we keep this or try to fix the DWR Proxy ->
											ordermgr/web/actions/AjaxSearchShiptoAction.java
										If we keep it, we can move the form 
						  		  			ordermgr/web/forms/AjaxExtjsPagerQueryForm.java
						  		  		to application-common.
						 - Open issues:
						 	- Exception handling / Error reporting in all use cases.
						 	  For the first 2 a special tile def is needed (similar to "normal" 
						 	  content tiledef, but with special error handling part that 
						 	  puts the errors into the right div) instead of the "plain" jsp
						 	  used now.
					- Look & Feel:
						- CSS and images are still work in progress, don't use them for other 
						  pages.
					- Menu:
						- Baisc idea is to have each page update a Session bean (plain Bean, not EJB)
						  telling that it is selected and to paint the menu using that information.
						  Current implementation with plain String might be modified in the future.
						  Advantage: we can have a selected menu and work with page URLs (even 
						  links into the app).
						  Disadvantage: Nearly 1:1 link between page and menu item, no crosslinks 
						  possible.
						  
Fix           : -
