Created On    : 04-Dec-2008 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST015: views wrk now, composite pk fix
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : views did not really work yet because we were defining each attr as @Id.
		Here's the problem with that:
		- JPA *needs* a pk class for composite ids
		- each retrieved attribute except for the first one was null as a result of this
		
		solution:
		- *first* attribute of a view is the pk.
		- currently only one attr may be pk in a vew
		- if one attribute is not enough, just concatenate the components of the pk 
		  within the view to the first attribute
		- for composite ids, we now generate pk classes
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M etc/gdi/jpaconsole/cartridge/templates/createQuery4all.vm
M logon-persistence/etc/gdi/schema2ddlentities/templates/java/entity.java.vm
A logon-persistence/etc/gdi/schema2ddlentities/templates/java/pkClass.java.properties
A logon-persistence/etc/gdi/schema2ddlentities/templates/java/pkClass.java.vm

