Created On    : 04-Dec-2008 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS020: service interfaces revamped
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 
		up to now:
		  - services needed to implement SvcLocal, SvcRemote and Svc
		    this was a pattern from sun, but unfortunately when
		    using services from other services, we habe to '@EJB xyz'
		    a service ifc which contains either @Local or @Remote
		from now on:
		  - got rid of SvcLocal, SvcRemote.
		  - only Svc needs to be implemented
		  - Svc will contain @Local or @Remote depending on the 
	        build.properties/build-local.properties
		  - Svc is now much more readable (using imports rather than
		    fully qualified class names)
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
