ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : COMMON021: Configured DWR error handler to show server side errors of DWR Ajax calls
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1.Added a custom DWR Remoter implementation (DwrCustomRemoter.java) which wraps the unexpected
		  exception into a LogonBusionessException (in order to generate error ID etc)
		2.Enabled the marshaling of Exceptions and StrackTraces in dwr.xml. WARNING: This setup is 
		  supposed to be used only for dev environments, for live environments it might be better
		  be switch off the marshaling of StackTraces (Security reasons). To be discussed later.
		3.Configured the DWR error handler to process the information about the exception and 
		  to adjust the DOM. The "classic" red box is injected into the DOM, followed by the stack trace below.
