Created On    : 29-Dec-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST072, BUSINESS039: refdata lookup for localized refdata
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : here are the changes
		- the generated sql scripts now also create text-views
		- text views join the bs+tx tables, giving access to the combined information
		- lookup refdata like so:
		    refDataService.findSignatureTypeEntityList(locale);
            refDataService.findSignatureTypeEntity(locale, 0);
		- the above example looks up data on VLGNR_SIGNATURE_TYPE
		- VLGNR_SIGNATURE_TYPE combines information of 
		  TLGNR_SIGNATURE_TYPE_BS and TLGNR_SIGNATURE_TYPE_TX
		NOTE: whenever you add new BS/TX tables, you need to:
		   adnant dist
		   execute logon-persistence/target/generated/gdi/schema2ddlentities/sql/create/30_gen_create_text_views.sql
		   cd logon-persistence
		   adnant oraviews
		... in order to have entities created automatically for the new views.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
