Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The newer spec contains not just one set of flags for Fax/
		E-Mail/SMS for order confirmation, but for order confirmation and
		delivery note.
Fix           : The ORDER_CONF_EMAIL_ADDRESSES/FAX_NUMBER/... are used for
		both the ORDER_CONF_ flags and the ..._DELIVNOTE_FLAG. The naming
		is not ideal, but this involves the least changes.
		Also made the loading-weighing nullable, and added a FK in ship-to
		to the railway station.
Workaround    : Updated DB as well, including comments.
