ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : ORDER041: Added common OrderServiceBean, including a changeOrderBulkprdStatus method
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1. Added common OrderServiceBean: this bean can be used as a common bean for shared, Order related
		   service methods:
		2. changeOrderBulkprdStatus(): This method modifies the status of an TLGNC_ORDER_BULKPRD entity,
		   and automatically inserts a new entry into the TLGNC_ORDER_BULKPRD_STATUS table with the new
		   status and the current timestamp. The setOrderStatus() method of the OrderBulkprdEntity 
		   must not be used anymore in order to keep the two tables in sync.
