Created On    : 20-Jan-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : SETUP051: selective build feature
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : it is now possible to omit building a subproject.
       see config/build-local.properties:

           # uncomment if you dou want to omit a component to build:
           #omit.subcomponent.common=true
           #omit.subcomponent.persistence=true
           #omit.subcomponent.webservices=true
           #omit.subcomponent.business=true
           #omit.subcomponent.common-web=true
           #omit.subcomponent.admin-web=true
           #omit.subcomponent.order-web=true
           #omit.subcomponent.application=true

        e.g. you could omit componets which are not interesting to
             you:
           # uncomment if you dou want to omit a component to build:
           #omit.subcomponent.common=true
           #omit.subcomponent.persistence=true
           #omit.subcomponent.webservices=true
           #omit.subcomponent.business=true
           #omit.subcomponent.common-web=true
           omit.subcomponent.admin-web=true
           #omit.subcomponent.order-web=true
           omit.subcomponent.application=true

        this will speed up build and deployment
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
