---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Created On    : 22-Jan-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST125: entities now always have @Temporal(TemporalType.TIMESTAMP) annotation
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : as announced by email...
	
	Date: Thu, 22 Jan 2009 11:37:36 +0100
	From: Alvaro Fussen <alvi@adnovum.hu>
	To: pegasus-dev@adnovum.ch
	Subject: logon: troubles with DATE and TIMESTAMP -> important change imminent

	Hi everyone,

	We're having some troubles with the way we're handling DATE and TIMESTAMP.

	*please* read and understand this especially in case you were/are dealing with date and time 
	*calculations*!

	General rule:

	TIMESTAMP: for technical fields ONLY!
	DATE: for application dates and times.
	     - dates with time portion
	     - dates without time portion (just year, month and days)

	Until now, we were able to differentiate between DATE with a time portion and pure dates (just year, 
	month and days):

	For dates with time portion, the entities are generated like so:

	1)    @Temporal(TemporalType.TIMESTAMP) (with DATE type on the DB)

	For pure dates (just year, month and days), the entities are generated like so:

	2)    @Temporal(TemporalType.DATE)

	Unfortunately, we have an inconsistency with the views, because we lose some information in our 
	approach:
	    -> see case 1 above: 'adnant oraviews' will think that it's a DATE (which is correct but the 
	entity generator will not know that the field should be in fact TemporalType.TIMESTAMP)

	Solution (will be introduced today): we will limit the number of types to...

	TIMESTAMP: for technical fields ONLY!
	DATE: for application dates and times, all dates with time portion

	This means: if you're dealing with date-calculations, you have to cut off the time portion yourself!

	Please contact me if you think that your code may be affected by this change.

	Cheers,
	Alvi.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/DispoServiceBean.java
M logon-persistence/etc/gdi/schema2ddlentities/templates/java/entity.java.vm
R logon-persistence/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/persistence/entities/custom/DispoAssignmentListEntity.java
R logon-persistence/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/persistence/entities/custom/DispoOrderListEntity.java

