Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Enabling security for both dev- and prod-setups
		Steps for Dev-Setup:
		- update your build-local.properties
		- set login.domain=DevDomain
		- set auth.method=BASIC
		- A basic auth popup will appear (Username: logonadmin, PW: logonadmin)
		- Roles and user names are NOT administrated in Logon App but in users.properties and profiles.properties
		- Please talk to me (thomas zweifel) before changing any settings
		Steps for Prod-Setup (Windows Package):
		- build.properties contains the correct settings login.domain=SPNEGO and auth.method=SPNEGO
		- Login is currently configured for the user jamesbond@HOLCIM.CH, further users will follow with the next login module
		- Configured users can access the application from their correctly configured IE or Firefox
