Created On    : 27-Jan-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 38688, 38710
ADN Change ID : ORDER051, SETUP054: Merging the tabs of admin and order
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : A redirection was needed, since the context root is different for the two subprojects, 
		and thus the paths were bad. 
		The redirection is done by the RedirectServlet which simply just sends a redirect back.
		It needs a request parameter redirectTo, which is actually present in the NavigationTile, 
		right in the tag component described below. 
		Added a tag component, which renders the decision if this redirect is needed or not. (In
		case of being at the order subprojects tabs there is no need to redirect, since the context
		root is the same. In this case RedirectServlet is not called, only when a switch is needed
		between the subprojects.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
