Created On    : 29-Jan-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST151: Removing .* notation from custom views
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : random order of columns and existence of old/temporarily
		columns became a big problem after we started to use several dbs
		(clean vs old dev db).
Description   : -
Fix           : Removed all .* notations from the view. Force explicit
		declaration of columns, and therefore also explicit order.
		Then updated customViews.xml according to the newest definition
		on ulgn11, as well as executing all generated views on ulgn01
		(to have a consistent state).
