ADN Change ID : SETUP056: fixed jsp precompilation
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : the webservices include jsps which don't seem to be precompilabe. excluded from,
		precompilation.
		
		Note: also fixed a quite serious bug in the way how we precompile wars (this came from MOAP):
		 - we loop through all wars, unwar them and precompile like so:
		        <mkdir dir="${jsp.precompile.dir}"/>
		        <mkdir dir="${jsp.precompile.unwar.dir}"/>
		        <unwar src="${temp.war.file}" dest="${jsp.precompile.unwar.dir}"/>
		        <jspcTC verbose="1" .../>
		-> this is very wrong, we either have to unwar each war into its own directory,
		or delete the unwar and precomp dir in each iteration.
		-> added delete statements.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
