		for CUSTOMER_CLASSIFICATION.
Description   : -
Fix           : Added a hack to drop/create the sequences in a safe range.
		But the proper solution is to modify the testdata, and bring them
		in a better, safe id range (for example, all negativ...).
		Call the fix scripts manually, after or before loading the testdata.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
