ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : SAPSERVICE059: NPE in callMethod... fixed + SOAP-requests are logged in *Skeleton classes in case of parse-errors.
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : - NPE in trace of the callMethod... fixed.
		- if the SOAP-requests are forwarded by Axis to the Skeleton instances,
		I check, if parsing of them are successful (successful = neither the incoming 
		request-document, nor its translated/parsed form is null). If this translation is
		not successful, a WsServerSideException is thrown. => 
		Something similar appears on the client-side:
     [exec] 14:06:01,265 ERROR [  WsExceptionHandler:25  ]        Service: MaterialMasterDataImport; Operation: material_master_data_put FAILED!;
     [exec] Details:com.holcim.logon.exception.WsServerSideException: ERROR-ID = gxvai-03641-08680; Invalid input: unable to parse the incoming SOAP-request. Check, if it is valid according to the WSDL definition of its service, please!

Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
