ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : WSCLIENT017: added basic auth for parallel ws client calls
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : the following properties control ws client behavior:
		
		parallel.host.url - if not set, the default soap:address from wsdl is used
		parallel.nocall - if set, no actual call is made
		parallel.user - if not set, no basic auth is done
		parallel.password - if not set, no basic auth is done

		order.delivery.url - if not set, the default soap:address from wsdl is used
		order.delivery.nocall - if set, no actual call is made
