Created On    : 18-Feb-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : COMMON044, SAPSERVICE064: soap request and response dumping revised, exception handling
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 
		- removed WsExceptionHandler: was redundant. We already have ExceptionUtil.
		- WebservicesRequestInfoFilter: didn't trace status correctly. created files with 1 which had exceptions
		- WebservicesRequestInfoFilter: used ERROR to dump the request. changed to DEBUG.
		- WebservicesRequestInfoFilter: no longer writes '.status' files, it now writes the full response
		- WebservicesRequestInfoFilter: more safety checks, robustness, create dump dir if it doesn't exist,
		                                also deal with deleting dump dir while the app is running
		- new properties (both optional):
		    soap.dump.dir - where to write the dump files
		    disable.soap.dumping - disables dumping if set
		- if 'soap.dump.dir' is not defined, we use 'currentdir/wsdump/ as a directory
		- *ExceptionHandler: using ExceptionUtil now
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

