---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Created On    : 04-Mar-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : INIT001: added init component
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : init is responsible for initializing the applicaion. initializing is a bit
		awkward in the J2EE world, especially when there is an ejb tier. jboss would provide
		special JMX mbeans for this, but that's container dependent.
		Another accepted alternative is using a web-app which triggers the init.
		logon-init is a war which will be contained within the logon-ear. It takes care of:
		   - reading the logon.properties (using spring)
		   - calling the config init on the ejb
		   - providing versionCheck
		   - initializing log4j.
		initializing is cleaner now because it is done only once istead of one time per web-app.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
