ADN Change ID : PERSIST276: Persistence Generator: Too many useless Sequences generated, mainly in refdata (PK varchar)
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 1. Sequences are created for non-numeric typed columns as well.
				(VARCHAR keys in refdata tables)
				2. Refdata tables containing text (_TX) have composite keys:
				LANG_CD + foreign key to the ID of their _BS pair => sequence
				should be generated only for the ID of the _BS table
Description   : -
Fix           : Sequences are only generated for numeric IDs (no VARCHAR or composite ones).
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
