Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : Adapted to removed tlgns_sap_shipto, and renaming in order:
		< join tlgnc_shipto st on (ord.sap_shipto_id = st.sap_shipto_id)
		< join tlgns_sap_shipto sst on (ord.sap_shipto_id = sst.sap_shipto_id)
		< join tlgns_sap_bp sbp on (sst.sap_bp_id = sbp.sap_bp_id)
		---
		> join tlgnc_shipto st on (ord.shipto_sap_bp_id = st.shipto_sap_bp_id)
		> join tlgns_sap_bp sbp on (st.shipto_sap_bp_id = sbp.sap_bp_id)
		and
		<         join tlgns_sap_shipto sst on (ord.sap_shipto_id = sst.sap_shipto_id)
		<         join tlgns_sap_bp sbp on (sst.sap_bp_id = sbp.sap_bp_id)
		---
		>       join tlgns_sap_bp sbp on (ord.shipto_sap_bp_id = sbp.sap_bp_id)
