Changes:
These are handled now with other fields: VBPA_PARVW and VBAP_KUNNR 
VBAK_KUNAG
WEMPF
REMPF

Some fields type changed, since now they are mapped:

Change  		|    Field 		| Comment

Date --> String 	|	VBEP_WADAT 	|	set see mapping in xls
Date --> String 	|	VBEP_WAUHR 	|	set see mapping in xls
String-->Double 	|	LIKP_BTGEW 	|	set see mapping in xls
String-->Double 	|	VBAK_ZZKM_ROAD 	|	set see mapping in xls
int --> Int 		|	VBAP_KWMENG 	|	is from now calculated by multiplying the DELIVERY_QUANTITY*UOM Multiplier since it is needed in tons

Renamed to 		|	VBAK_ZZKMBAHN (it was VBAK-ZKMANZ) | not set

Added 			|	ZDISBA2_GLEIS 	| 	not set
Added 			|	LIKP_NTGEW 	|	set see mapping in xls
Added 			|	ZDISBA2_WAGGR 	|	not set
Added 			|	ZV2_SBBNHM  	|	not set

The code was not adapted to the changes in TLGNC_ASSIGNMENT added ACTIVE_FLAG field, now it is adapted.
