Created On    : 23-Mar-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 39857, 39594
ADN Change ID : PERSIST311, ADMIN265: Added silo type refdata tables, trailer transport category refdata tables
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Trailer_type_bs contained the values, what should be in the trailer transport category, thus I added them to
		the new transport refdata table. Now it contains the refdata values what were defined. 
		Added silo_type table, which contains the ref silo type values defined in 20090202_Pegasus - LOGON Benutzer Interface 
		Spezifikation (Excel) Version 1.0.0.9.1.xls kundensilo and baustellen silo tabs. 
		TLGNC_SHIPTO_SILO was modified: added OVERRIDE_UNLOADING_FLAG, which is a flag deciding if the UNLOADING_TIME value
		must or must not be updated from the SHIPTO bzw. the LOGON DEFAULT value. It is not clear if the current customer silo
		administration should have this flag or should not. In case it should not, it must be updated to accept null.
		TLGNC_SHIPTO_SILO now contains reference to the silo type, not nullable detto, since in the xls it says for kundensilos
		the type selection is also there. It is not clear that the Dispokarte screen's customer silo administration part should
		or should not contain the type flag or not. If it won't this must also be made nullable later.
		TLGNC_SHIPTO_SILO now contains a TYPE_FLAG which describes that the silo is a kundensilo or a baustellen silo. The functionality
		used until this time was adding modifying kundensilos, thus that part must be updated to set this flag accordingly.
		TLGNC_TRAILER got a TRAILER_TRANSPORT_CAT_BS foreign key to the corresponding table, since now the screen also uses the categories.
		Trailer functionality now acts according to the category selection, thus that was also updated.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
