ADN Bugzilla  : 40391
ADN Change ID : CFG064, COMMON062: Encoding issues webservic dump and sap testclient
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Changes:
		- file.encoding of the container has been set to UTF-8 (no more OS depending settings);
		- request/repsonse is logged with character/file-encoding UTF-8;
		This way I had no more problems during running the TestClient and processing utf-8 
		encoded soap-requests (read from utf-8 encoded request-dump files). It means, that no 
		more ?? are inserted to the DB instead of the characters with umlaut, etc.
		Checked in the staging area of DCHLGN01.
