Created On    : 30-Mar-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST336, COMMON064, BUSINESS070, SAPSERVICE093, WSCLIENT044: revamped request handling for ws clients and server
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : this is quite a big overhaul and includes these changes:
		- wsdumping now done for all ws clients and server (requests and responses (except vor void-clients))
		- wsserver now reads the config from the DB correctly (wasn't hooked up before)
		- wsserver now has filter-config for sub dir set (like in the mop-incoming component)
		- large number directory problem addressed. we dump into daily directories
		- renamed inconsistent property (wsserver.disable.soap.dumping -> wsserver.soap.dumping.disable)
		- added property 'wsclient.soap.dump.dir' amd 'wsclient.soap.dump.disable'
		- much simpler API for ws client (using a ClientConfig bean), simplified client implementation
		- client setup is now generated rather than programmed 'by hand'
		- clients are no longer enums (but we might need to revert that later on.)
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

