Created On    : 08-Apr-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 39022
ADN Change ID : PERSIST374: tlgnr_uom_dimension, aka BASE UOM
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Until now, all units counted as 'weight' unit, with
		an implicit base unit of 1 ton. However, there are pieces and
		hours, which cannot be expressed in tons.
Description   : -
Fix           : Introduced "Dimension". It's on purpose that not
		"Base unit" is used, because that term is already in use
		in Holcim, but for something else (base unit of a material,
		sales unit, etc).
		Dimension is the scientific approach, and should express
		that time and weight and piece are fundamentally different.
		(Also, some missing db comments in bizevent and uom added)
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

