Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : CTL_MOD_... fields are declared as not-null, having default values
				that must be removed later. Also the setters for CTL_CRE... and
				CTL_MOD_... fields are removed from entities (should be set automatically
				on persisting and merging the entity, non-accessible by clients).
				The CTL_TCN field is private and has no getter/setter methods (
				handled by JPA).
				The ATTR_... constants are still generated for all the CTL_...
				fields, so that they can be used in criteria based queries (GDI Filter).
