Created On    : 23-Apr-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 40969
ADN Change ID : ADMIN329, ORDER215,PERSIST424: Added default fallback to shipto, loadingpoint, silo, dropped fields
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The new tag DefaultFallBackLogicTag uses DefaultFallbacklogic, what determines what value has to be used
		for shipto, silo, or loadingpoint. It can later be extended to be usable with other types and default 
		fallbacks. The DefaultFallBackLogic has functions which simply return the value what has to be used as
		unloading, loading times.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : Known issue that if the value is not valid it is cleared, and is not preserved. Will fix it later, its not possible 
		to save bad values anyway. (message says that the value is not valid, but is not present anymore).
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
