Created On    : 28-Apr-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticketcenter/show_bug.cgi?id=ADN41194
ADN Change ID : ADMIN340: UC 11018 - TransactionRequiredException when railway station...
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : error was actually an optimisticlockingexception. reason:
		
		the action did this:
		
					   shippingPointService.updateShippingPoint(helpForm.getShippingPoint(), loadingPoints);
		
		... but we need to return the updated ShippingpointEntity and set that in the form.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
