Created On    : 05-May-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST441: DB tables for background services (status, communication)
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : See SAPSERVICE108.
Description   : The usage of the fields in the tlgnc_cronstatus is described
		in the extensive DB comments. It basically follows the proposed design
		of https://aww.adnovum.ch/twiki/bin/view/HolcimPegasus/SAPStagingAreaAndImport
		but tries to use names which could be used for other kind of background
		tasks as well, i.e. not just SAP import.
		Therefore, the LAST_WEBSERVICECALL_TS was renamed into NEW_DATA_AVAILABLE_TS.
		Also, features which are not yet implemented, have NOT yet been added:
		- MASTER_SERVERNAME -> simply set jobs to inactive in dev env, or in config)
		- LAST_ERRORREPORT_TS -> do later, when we are sure how we do error reporting.
		  (could also be, that the error reporting is done in a seperate background job.
		  Or not at all -> tablebrowser in tlgnc_log)
		TODO: Make SAP importers based on those, check is useful/what's missing.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
