Description   : to start simulator: cd logon-simulator && adnant start
		NOTE: 
		- soapui has the nasty behavior to store absolute paths in all its files. therefore
		we patch whatever soapui writes. in order for this to work, you must exit soapui
		properly (File->exit). This will call 'patch' automayically.
		- naming is done like this: cs-incoming will hold whatever the nufatron-comserver sees as incoming
		- currently we only have cs-incoming
		- yet to come: cs-outgoing, pi-incoming, pi-outgoing
