ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : CFG089: Enabling form based auth for devs and making jboss port configurable
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Login Module Change:
		
		With this change, the parameters auth.method.lan, auth.method.dmz, loginpage.dmz and 
		errorpage.dmz are replaced with login.config.lan and login.config.dmz. The new 
		parameters hold the xml login-config for the required module.

		PLEASE UPDATE YOUR build-local.properties!

		You will now get a form based login and will soon be able to use a logout for 
		easier testing of roles (currently, Logout.do does not yet fully work aka gives 
		a 500er error).

		JBoss Port:
		jboss.bind.port now defines the used jboss port for dev setups. For pkg setups, 
		this parameter will be moved to installation time.
