		SQL to load initial person/user/driver etc data
Description   : Original file:
		/share/doc/holcim/pegasus/input/database/2009-05-12_user_person_driver_role.xls
		Saved as CSV, removing/commenting only the obviously bad lines (headers,
		empty lines at the bottom), and then running the GDI generator.
		Advantages of this approach:
		- sequences can easily be used
		- updates from Holcim possible
		- ctl_cre/mod/... fields are generated, as well as other defaults,
		such as initial lifetime of passwords etc.
