Created On    : 22-May-2009 / zsolt
ADN Bugzilla  : ADN40585
ADN Change ID : ORDER295: UC 6013 Credit Note (Gutschrift) an SAP uebermitteln
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 
		During processing a credit note:
		1) if flag 'Yes' has been chosen, 
		1a) a new Order Delivery is sent to SAP "made off" the existing Order and OrderItem 
		using the Returned Quantity and setting the ZRETURN flag to 1;
		1b) the RETURN_HANDLING_CD of the affected entity of TLGNC_ORDER_ITEM is 
		set to 4 ('Credit Note created').
		2) if flag 'No' has been chosen, the RETURN_HANDLING_CD of the affected entity of 
		TLGNC_ORDER_ITEM is set to 0 ('No adjustment needed (or credit note refused)').
		It is possible to process multiple Credit Notes at the same time, both of them are 
		processed in separate transactions.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
