ADN Bugzilla  : 40742
ADN Change ID : PERSIST508: Prototype to translate missing refdata TX entries into all 4 languages.
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : If a user works in a language such as 'fr' or 'it' it may be
		that he cannot look at some objects, because the lookup of reference
		data values fails if those translations are missing.
Description   : We decided against implementing a fallback in the application
		and instead make sure, that all values are in the DB (redundant to
		'en' or 'de', whatever makes sense for each table).
Fix           : As a prototype, added the automatica adding of missing values
		to all refdata a* and b*.
		Because of the newly added csv2sql infrastructure we may reconsider
		this, and generate this statement for the refdata tables.
