ADN Change ID : WSCLIENT062, BUSINESS122: The Parallel server to address depends on loadingpoint/plant
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 
		- added 'String loadingpoint' to the API of LogonToParallel
		- added '// af20090528: FIXME! pass over correct string!' wherever LogonToParallel 
		  is called from non-test code
		
		-> TODO: get the correct string from the loadingpoint
		
		explanation:
		- requests will be sent to: http://${name}/LogonToPISrv/LogonToPI.asmx (see tlgnr_config)
		- ${name} will be replaced by the selected loadingpoint-parallel server configuration
		- 'name' is retrieved from tlgnr_config like so:
		      fetch 'wsclient.parallel.host.name.<loadingpoint>
		thus:
		      wsclient.parallel.host.name.dotternhausen
		
		would be used with this call:
		
		      LogonToParallel.versionNr(getConfigBean(), "dotternhausen"));
