ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1240: PDF generation with color type 6 pngs fixed
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : As far jcan print does not support the color type 6 pngs (with alpha channel) 
		and in pdfs in fact we do not need transparency at all, we convert alpha pixels
		to white, and thus make compatible for jcanprint.
		As far in the db may be from the beginning good type 1,2,3 type pngs, and jpgs which are ok
		from the beginning, we do not need this manipulation for every png just for the unsupported ones,
		 thus this is going to be a second try in case we got an unsupported exception.
