Created On    : 03-Jun-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 40742
ADN Change ID : PERSIST534: Adding missing refdata in all languages.
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : When TX entries are missing for a few keys in some
		languages (it, fr), this can lead to data not shown in the
		application (because no fallback is implemented).
		See prototype implemented in PERSIST508: Prototype to translate
		missing refdata TX entries into all 4 languages
Description   : -
Fix           : Now added that sql fragment in a GDI generator,
		and call for all tables.
		The list of tables is generated with an SQL statement contained
		in the refdata_in_all_languages.csv file (self documenting
		input).
		Removed the manually copied sql from the individual insert
		sql script. They don't belong there, because many of them should
		eventually be generated themselves (getting rid of the 
		default for ctl_cre_ts etc)
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

