ADN Change ID : COMMON136, INIT007: now make sure that the web-tier accesses the local version of LogonProperties
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : because LogonProperties came from the service, the 'zone' always delivered the zone that
		was originally set when the application was initialized.
		Now, we make sure that the configbean will always have the local version of LogonProperties set
		whenever it is retrieved from the services. In the web tier there are only 3 relevat places where
		this happens. (there is one unrelevant place: WebservicesRequestInfoFilter, but that one
		always runs in the 'lan' zione, so that will be set correctly automatically.)
