		columns, not just for PDF.
Description   : As a consequence, rename it (consistent to tlgnc_mat_shippingpoint).
		Also corrected comments, naming (ce_norm instead of ce_normo), and
		introduced a real FK constraint. Note, that this table cannot easily
		be loaded with data as tlgnc_pdf_logo_rules, because we now have
		a reference to sap_material_id (not a non-enforced one to sap_material_no).
		To provide good initial data we should first add proper REAL and
		complete SAP material data to intialdata (until now, we only have
		testdata, incomplete)
