Created On    : 15-Jun-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 41896
ADN Change ID : PERSIST565: Added utitily view to find incomplete SAP Materials
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : If descriptions in certain languages are missing, it may
		be that such records become "invisible" completely in the UI,
		because of inner joins, or outer join but no meaningful value
		to display
Description   : -
Fix           : For refdata, a cleanup procedure insert all missing
		entries for the specified refdata tables (run at the end of
		each patch/db creation).
		For SAP data Holcim agreed that it's the responsibility to
		send all the languages in use.
		To quickly detect materials which do not have as many
		languages as we have in tlgnr_lang_bs, a utility view
		has been added to show those:
		select * from VLGNS_UTIL_SAPMATDESC_MISSING
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

A logon-persistence/etc/database/views/vlgns_util_sapmatdesc_missing.xml
