ADN Change ID : ADMIN457: User Admin bugfixes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : UC 11012 - search by role - performance problems if many results (42308) - problem solved with using a (already existing) view in a subquery (VLGNU_USER_ROLE_SELECTION) to fetch user ids of the users had a certain role. The original solution used TLGNU_USER_ROLE for fetching this information, but UserRoleEntity has EAGER fetching for both User and Role, and that resulted a huge trace code which slowed down the processing. 
UC 11012 - field Vorname / Fristname (42720) - exchanging wrong title Active to First name
