		current_truck_id, because that field is not even editable
		in the user admin.
Description   : Analysis showed, that the application relies on
		driver:truck being 0/1 : 0/1, and that the application
		resets any other older driver, if it is informed about
		a truck-driver change.
		(see MOP105: remove selected truck from other drivers,
		ticket ADN39995)
