ADN Change ID : ORDER444: fix to submit the value of  disabled checkboxes 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 

- when a checkbox is disable on the jsp its value (whether checked or not
checked) will not be submitted -> a hidden field is introduced with each
checkbox
- this fixes the problem with disabled restriction active flag
- this fixes the problem with disabled release SAP flag
- the value of the holdBackSapFlag is inverted when loading the shipto and
once more before saving it. The reason is that on the screen the flag is
called 'release SAP' thus the meaning is just the opposite as in the DB.
Inverting the flag is not a nice solution but this was the safest & easier way
-> should be rewritten later

