ADN Change ID : PERSIST588: BP restriction checks fail
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : access limitation works now. the problem was that the generated jpa
                statements had an error in case of SapBpEntity. Now we are more type
                safe to make sure that this problem no longer exists. (i.e. we'd get
                a compile time error if the query uses wrong bindings)

                the actual error was:
                Caused by: org.hibernate.QueryException: could not resolve property: soldtoSapBpId of: com.holcim.logon.persistence.entities.sap.SapBpEntity [select x from com.holcim.logon.persistence.entities.common.OrderEntity x  where orderNumber = ?1  and ( 1 = 1  and  (SOLDTO_SAP_BP_ID is null or SOLDTO_SAP_BP_ID IN (select soldtoSapBp.soldtoSapBpId from com.holcim.logon.persistence.entities.admin.UserSoldtoBpAccEntity where user.userId = ?2)) )]

