Created On    : 29-Jun-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticketcenter/show_bug.cgi?id=ADN43081
ADN Change ID : CFG122: OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   :
		changed from:
		    -server -XX:PermSize=48m -XX:MaxPermSize=328m -Xms128m -Xmx128m
		to
		    -server -XX:PermSize=128m -XX:MaxPermSize=328m -Xms512m -Xmx512m -XX:+UseParallelGC
		in dmz, lan and dev env.
		
		New settings are based on:
		- http://java.sun.com/performance/reference/whitepapers/tuning.html
		- actual memory usage of logon, after (mostly) all subsystems have been used.
		
		We should now have ample memory for the time being.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
