Created On    : 02-Jul-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 43189
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1305: After merging rfidobject it is going to be reload see description why
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The rfidobject tag detach works as setting the back rfidobject_id reference to null.
		If you merge it, it will be updated, and next time you reload it won't be present in the
		rfidtag list, because it is not attached anymore to that object. 
		Until this time at most places the whole containing structure was reloaded
		and the changes in the rfid list took effect then. But since optimization of Dispokarte
		the shipto is not reloaded anymore, only the merged entity will be kept, which still will contain
		the detached tag, only with null rfidobject_id. This was the cause of the problem.
		From now the rfidobject is going to be reloaded in case it was merged in order to have
		the correct rfid list when returning to Dispokarte.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/RFIDServiceBean.java

