Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : in some use cases (Order and Dispocard) we need to display all data, e.g. all pools.
		We can now fetch data unrestricted if we do the following before a dao-call:
                   PoolTxEntityDao dao = getDaoProvider().getPoolTxEntityDao();
                   // next dao call will retrieve unrestricted data
                   Authorizer.disableNextAccessRestriction();
                   List entities = dao.find(filter);
		note that this will fetch urestricted data exactly once. after this, data access is restricted again.
		
		-> now usecases Order and Dispocard are done in respect to access restrictions.
