Created On    : 10-Jul-2009 / boon
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : ADMIN510, BUSINESS1313,PERSIST623, SAPSERVICE133: Cron status job execution refactoring.
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1) Moved all quartz jobs from logon-webservice to logon-admin-web.
		2) Jobs don't handle cronstatus.last_start_ts/last_end_ts anymore, this is done by the job executor.
		3) Removed cronstatus.active_flag, jobs are enabled in tlgnr_config.
		4) Changed settings in tlgnr_config, the settings pda.session.cleaner.enable, rfid.label.sync.enable, sapimport.cron.job.enable, sapimport.log.cleaner.enable are not used anymore. Instead, the setting <cronstatus.name>.cron_enabled is checked; pda_session_reaper.cron_enabled, rfid_object_label_cleanup.cron_enabled, sapimport_bp.cron_enabled, sapimport_cond.cron_enabled, sapimport_mat.cron_enabled, sapimport_vendor.cron_enabled, sapimport_clean_log.cron_enabled.
		5) Renamed cronexpression variable names into <cronstatus.name>.cron_expression.
