Created On    : 14-Jul-2009 / cosmin
ADN Bugzilla  : 43479
ADN Change ID : DISPO114: Disposition screen is slow
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Dispo screen needs about 30s to display the dispo table with 100 trucks
				Drag & drop is nearly impossible to use on the same table
				Description   : 2 problems found
					1. The IE table rendering engine causes all calls retrieving a position to be awfully slow
					   when a big table is involved. This accounts for 25s out of 30 when rendering the table
	   				   and for most of the Drag & drop problem.
	   				2. getElementById also tends to become slow on large pages. This accounts for about 3s
					   at pool switch and for some noticeable delay (maybe 1s) when dragging an bar.
Fix           : 1. use table-layout:fixed; on big tables
				2. not implemented yet: don't use Ext DDTargets for the Drag & Drop operations, but find a 
				   simpler manual implementation like for the horizontal dragging
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/webapp/css/dispo.css

