Created On    : 14-Jul-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 43658
ADN Change ID : COMMON171, ORDER529: Autoforward flag logic for bestellung
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Server side
		In case none of the flags is set, the order goes to status new. 
		In case only pool autoforward checkbox is set, the order goes to transmitted to pool status.
		In case carrier autoforward is set, the order goes to transmitted to carrier.

		On the UI
		1)As far the initial values must come from the dispokarte, the logic will not update the 
		checkboxes when entering the screen, but will definitely prevent bad input by sending warnings.
		For ex. on dispokarte both flags is set, but no preselection is given for pool and carrier.

		2) When any change happens to dropdowns, or checkboxes, the following logic is going to be applied:

		Setting carrier flag will set to on, and disable pool flag. 
		Unsetting the pool flag will unset the carrier flag. 
		No other logic is attached apart from this bound they are independent.

		Besides if pool is not selected, auto forward flag pool/carrier cannot be selected,
		they become disabled. 
		If carrier is not selected auto forward carrier flag is disabled.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-common/src/main/resources/LitDict.properties
M logon-common/src/main/resources/LitDict_en.properties
