Created On    : 15-Jul-2009 / gerard
ADN Bugzilla  : 43714
ADN Change ID : ORDER531: do not cancel order in Parallel if load started
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 'cancel order' sent to parallel during startLoad event. Parallel rejects request.
Description   : loadingpoint on order item not set or not equal to what parallel sends. Thus
                Logon tries to re-send order to Parallel for correct display on terminal. This
				however whould only be true for loginParallel by PDA.
Fix           : Do not cancel Parallel order during startLoad/endLoad, but only set the loadingpoint
				on the order item if is has changed. Do only cancel order in Parallel during
				loginParallel.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
