Created On    : 15-Jul-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 41904
ADN Change ID : PERSIST624: Prepare DB for handling of SAP transport conditions
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : The current structure of the tlgns_sap_transport_cond and
		tlgns_sap_mat_cond wit the SAP condition types would not support
		the handling of the different transport conditions well.
		Also, to add the additional rules to handle material conditions
		correctly (hierarchy) becomes tricky, and fragile.
Description   : -
Fix           : To cope with this, the existing tlgnr_sap_condition_type
		is replaced by tlgnr_cond_sap_type and tlgnr_cond_logon_type,
		with additional information about evaluation priority.
		The new reference has been added to these two tables
		tlgns_sap_transport_cond and tlgns_sap_mat_cond
		Left todo: adapt importer, change handling of existing mat
		cond, implement new for transport cond, remove the old tables
		tlgnr_sap_condition_type_bs/tx.
		Full info, see:
		https://aww.adnovum.ch/twiki/bin/view/HolcimPegasus/WorkshopHolcim20090622#Minutes_1_Transport_Conditions
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
