ADN Change ID : ORDER537, CUST060, PERSIST625: Free of charge flag for bestellung
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Added column FREE_DELIVERY_FLAG for TLGNC_ORDER. It is disabled-off in case the sarea
		does not make it possible to set the orders to free of charge. It is enabled, if the sarea
		gives the opportunity to set free of charge. The flag is initially set to on in case on
		dispokarte material conditions Free of charge billto is selected (this is also only possible
		in case the sarea makes it possible to set free, otherwise the option is not available there
		either.)
		Billto field is mandatory from now in Bestellung and Webbestellung too, gives a warning, and refuses
		save in case no billto was selected.
