Created On    : 16-Jul-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 39105
ADN Change ID : PERSIST627: DB Model for transport zones, refdata and vertex/polygon
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : initial refdata from holcim, stored in tlgnr_trsp_zone_bs/tx
Description   : -
Fix           : Changed naming in mat/transport cond to shorter name "trsp_zone_cd"
		instead of "transportation_zone_cd".
		- A zone has a code, country, active
		- A polygon refers to a zone, and has color and z-index
		- A vertex refers to a polygon, and - defined by the seq_no, the
		  list of vertices for one polygon defines the polyton. The vertex
		  has the coordinates.
