Created On    : 16-Jul-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 43515
ADN Change ID : COMMON175: Added tag, which retrieves the first available tabs url
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Until now the AuthorizationTag worked as: if any of the subtabs is accessible
		evaluated the body, but with a static url, which was in most cases the first subtab.
		This caused troubles whenever the user was not authorized to see the first subtab.
		As the tag knows exactly at which functionality it decided to show the main tab,
		now it will lay out the corresponding url to that functionality's entryaction.
		The mapping is currently placed in the tag itself,;ater it would be nice to 
		have the functionality entryaction to url mapping as a generated
		map, because in each case the url of the entryaction should be known.
		There are entryactions, which does not have functionality yet.
