Created On    : 22-Jul-2009 / gerard
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : MOP227: more flexible RFIDadmin, better heuristic for finding RFID object
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : RFIDadmin creates new RFIDObject if no matching found, but
				LOGON does not (yet) provide the possibility to administrate/reassign
				those RFID tags.
Description   : RFID object label is the technical one (with prefixes), which the user
				simply cannot know (and is not known in the adminRFID event).
Fix           : 
    - RFID tag label/name optional
	- Create new RFID tag if none matching found (and label specified)
	- Do not create new RFID object if none matching found but store/update
	  without RFID object reference. This way the misc. admin screen can
	  choose the new RFID tag to assign to an object.
	- see also mail thread "RFID Admin via PDA"
	- add some heuristic for finding the correct RFID object:
	  - search by object type
	  - 'normalize' label given and search for "like '%label'", take
	    object if exactly one match, don't take any object if multiple
		(or none) found.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
