Symptoms      : -
Description   : removed unnecessary prefixes to make the code cleaner
				standard (YYYY/MM/NAME) namespace name is used for MOP wsdl, moved to logon.holcim.com (was logon.holcim.net)
				  - for LOGON it is not used yet, because of strange AXIS exception:
				  description: org.apache.axis2.AxisFault: Missing operation for soapAction [http://logon.holcim.net/logonevent/LOGONEventPort/consume] and body element [{http://logon.holcim.com/2009/09/LOGONEvent/}consume] with SOAP Version [SOAP 1.1]
				       [exec]              at org.apache.axis2.util.Utils.getInboundFaultFromMessageContext(Utils.java:512)
                       [exec]              at org.apache.axis2.description.OutInAxisOperationClient.handleResponse(OutInAxisOperation.java:370)
			           [exec]              at org.apache.axis2.description.OutInAxisOperationClient.send(OutInAxisOperation.java:416)
