Created On    : 09-Sep-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticketcenter/show_bug.cgi?id=44767
ADN Change ID : COMMON203, BUSINESS1343: same transfer-id for different calls
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : slightly change the handling. up till now:
		-> in case the business was located on localhost (thus, local), we didn't
		initialize op in the delegates because optracing was done only in the
		business-dispatchers. this is indeed a problem.
		new way:
		-> we always create the (op) context, however, we store the fact whether
		it's a local or remote call in the TransferContext, and don't do op tracing
		in the business tier. We do op tracing in the client.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

