Created On    : 15-Sep-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 45371
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1346, WSCLIENT079: Order SAP async removed the fields and updated wsdl to the current required
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Removed: VBAP_ZZWAKAT, ZDSIBAZ_WAGGR, ZV2_SBBNHM, VBAK_ZZKMBAHN, ZDISBA2_LP, ZDISBA2_GLEIS
		In the new wsdl these fields are not present anymore.
		In wsdl the address has changed to r5072.ea.holcim.net:50300.
		In the setting of fields the tare-weight-from-all-loads is calculated as sum of TARE_WEIGHT_T of
		the truck carrying the items of the order. In case the more items are carryied on the same truck
		(TLGNC_LOAD/TRUCK_ID is the same) then the trucks weight will be added only once to the gross weight.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
