Created On    : 17-Sep-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST722: Initial data for tlgnc_mat_plant
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Because of the mix of initial/testdata character, the
	execution of the generated tlgnc_mat_plant lead to 0 rules
	loaded. Reason: in AdN, the materials are loaded AFTER
	the initial data, as testdata! But the tlgnc_mat_plant
	should really be INITIAL data at Holcim
Description   : -
Fix           : As first part of the fix, execute the script twice,
	once in initialdata (=> 0 inserts), and once in testdata
	again (=> now, after all our materials are loaded).
	The correct solustion (see fix-me's) is to get the initial
	list of SAP materials from Holcim, and include them as
	initial data as well.
