Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Until now LKW terminal editability depended mainly on the order statuses. The new requirement
		is to be editable until the unloading_ts is not set. Still the order status changes will happen only
		the first time the weight is entered on the LKW terminal.
		There was a part, which checked if there are unloaded loads for the truck. As far there are more
		than one items, and probably more than one loads, this logic had to be adapted to check if that order belongs to
		the same assignment, and only update the unloading_ts of the other loads in case they are for different
		assginments.
