Created On    : 25-Sep-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST738: Extend shipto/shippingpoint model for all rail-order cases
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Orders need to be generated for rail return orders as well.
		To model all cases correctly, and to make them fit into the logon
		order model (from=shippingpoint, to=shipto), additional shippingpoint
		types and shipto types are introduced. Also an additional link between
		shipto -> shippingpoint is needed, as well as extending shippingpoint
		to "logon-only"-shippingoints (not in SAP):
