ADN Change ID : COMMON231, ORDER702, PERSIST779: Authorization for monitoring tab
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Till now credit note was authorized with reporting_map, which I suppose was in fact for reporting tabs
		subtab (do not know which, but for sure not credit note). As far ORDER_VIEW_2 auth is not used for anything,
		I adapted the roles involved, and use that auth for credit note from now.
		POOL_ASSIGNMENT was used for Auftragsuberwachung, the auth changed for that according to the spec.
		Monitoring was authorized together with order search, but since the new spec wants to hide that for certain
		roles, it had to be moved to another auth group, from now ORDER_VIEW_3. This is the same group as for kritische
		auftrage that uses the same auth, but as far it does not exist yet, this does not mean too much, just to show the main tab or not.
		In case it won't be merged with monitoring tab, it will require a new authorization group, but for the moment
		it seems it will be removed as tab, and merged the functionality with monitoring.
		Live map is authorized for poolfuhrer, added auth for him too.
