ADN Change ID : PERSIST782: Prepare for wagon volume restriction, change NHM mat codes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 1) Confusing: 'max_load_t' did not clearly specify that it was _net_,
		and the comments even said 'gross' by mistake.
		=> clarified with holcim, and renamed to max_net_load_t.
		2) besides weight restriction, there is also a volume restriction when
		loading a wagon. Clarified with holcim, we use the real material
		densities
		=> Extended tlgnc_mat_plant
		3) NHM codes are no longer sent to SAP, only the SAP Material Number.
		=> Therefore, prepare change in wagon_type, that SAP instead of NHM
		is stored. UI needs to be updated.
