ADN Bugzilla  : 44520, 46945
ADN Change ID : ORDER708, CUST084, COMMON235, PERSIST785: Order detail authorization added
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Until now order detail screen was saveable in case one had the authorization function
		ORDER_DETAIL_W. Unfortunely there are a lot of fields, which can be edited by other people,
		who do not have this functionality, but have the right to change other fields. The fields
		have separate authorization functions.
		From now the order detail screen will show disabled those until now editable fields, in case
		one is not authorized to change it, but will show in most cases the save button, since almost
		each role can edit several fields. The code parts, where the orders attributes are updated are
		authorized separately with the corresponding functions checking if the user has right to change it 
		or not.
		Fixed saving of carrier dropdown of order detail.
		Added right for poolfuhrer and management to see order search according to the latest UI spec.
		For webbestellung added setting of non nullable fields, since they were missing.
