Created On    : 22-Oct-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 46826
ADN Change ID : ADMIN602, BUSINESS1406, COMMON236, PERSIST787: Wagon type nhm code handling changes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The nhm codes are resolved from tlgnr_wagon_tpe_bs empty, repair and maintenance material nos.
		If their name could not be resolved (because of missing entry in TLGNS_SAP_MATERIAL) they will be shown
		with red, only with the number on screen. In this case the NHM code for sure cannot be resolved, that will show
		also red warning message that the nhm code is missing or not unique through plants. S101 thus is not hardcoded
		anymore, i expect one and single NHM code for one empty_sap_material_no which is the same for all plants. If not, warning 
		is shown.
		In case there is an entry in TLGNS_SAP_MATERIAL_NO, and corresponding entry in TLGNS_SAP_MATERIAL_DESCRIPTION, the name 
		will be resolved from that TXT field, the sap_mat_no will be shown in brackets.
		If there is no entry in TLGNS_SAP_MATERIAL_PLANT for this material, the warning will be shown still, because the NHM code 
		cannot be resolved.
		To be fully visible without warnings on wagon detail screen needed: filled in EMPTY_SAP_MATERIAL_NO (and the applies for
		repair, and maintenance), entry with this SAP_MATERIAL_NO in TLGNS_SAP_MATERIAL, entry for the given language in 
		TLGNC_SAP_MATERIAL_DESCRIPTION, at least one entry in TLGNS_SAP_MATERIAL_PLANT OR if the same material is for more plants
		the NHM code must be the same for them (such as plant_cd = S101 + sap_mat_id=1 nhm_code=456456 AND another entry plant_cd=S145
		+ sap_mat_id=1 and NHM_CODE=456456) in this case the NHM code could be retrieved uniquely.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-admin-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/admin/web/actions/masterdata/AbstractWagonDetailAction.java
