ADN Bugzilla  : 44356, 47175, 47239, 47296
ADN Change ID : ADMIN603, ORDER709, BUSINESS1408, PERSIST788: Terminal screen measure input changes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In truck administration only an additional parameter was added to the fetchTrailerForTruck 
		(to retrieve not only active but trailer for truck) and the same for trailer administration.
		For terminal screen the gross measure input field is again available for BULK loads.
		It is mainly driven by the net measure and tara measure, and in case it is edited it will change the
		net measure, but will never change the tare measure.
		In orderservice the composition of the load from now contains the trucks container as well in case the truck 
		has one, and that is also used in case the tare weight is left empty.
		Change on terminal screen is that there is the possibility to delete the tare measure in order to let
		the parallel set again, because due to 44356 calls from parallel will not overwrite the tare quantity
		of the load anymore, they will only set it, it case it was empty before.
