Created On    : 27-Oct-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 45645
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1414, ORDERMGR033, TEST174, ORDER713: Startload nulls driveto ts, endload sends message to pda in case of abort
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : For terminal screen there is 3 artificial state distinguished: 
		1 is before anything has happened (this is the case if loading_ts is not set, and drive_to part is also null)
		2 after tare has been set (this is the case if loading_ts is set, but drive_to part is yet null)
	`	3 after netto and tare has been set (which included the case when tare was left empty because that will get masterdata measure) (both mentioned ts above is set)
		In case 3 it means that a special case happenes, which will be handled separately by terminal screens service.
		Changes in startload: 
		1 function startload will always delete the drive-to parts ts to null, because it means that an endload has to happen in order to be in a sane state (case 3)
		2 function startload will send a startload message in case the loading_ts is null before updating the measure data
		Changes in endload: 
		1 function endload will send a message to pda if the load has been aborted
		Change for terminal screen: 
		1 startload comes always before endload thus it will act as any other part which uses startload/endload (until this time only endload was executed in case netto was set)
		2 the special case load abort must be considered as a special case, which resets everything (even after state 3 it can go to state 1)
		As a result of the change there should always be a startload+endload pair coming after each other not depending on where the update comes from. see ticket 46005
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/OrderChangeServiceBean.java
M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/OrderServiceBean.java
A logon-business/src/test/integration/com/holcim/logon/ejbtest/TerminalScreenTestCase.java

