Created On    : 04-Nov-2009 / alvi
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticketcenter/show_bug.cgi?id=43878
ADN Change ID : CFG177: Access to HTTP should redirect to HTTPS
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : added two new build-time config parameters:
		> # set to 'true' and requests to http:// will be redirected to https://
		> redirect_to_https.dmz=true
		> redirect_to_https.lan=false
		
		You can set the redirect policy for both applications, however, our current
		build.properties enable this only for the dmz
		
		In build-dev.properties, these properties are set to false.
		
		Note that JBOSS must have a https connector activated and the redirectPort
		must be set to the used port for https:
		
		    <!-- Define an AJP 1.3 Connector on port 8009 -->
		    <Connector port="8009" address="${jboss.bind.address}" protocol="AJP/1.3"
		         emptySessionPath="true" enableLookups="false" redirectPort="8443" />
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
