Created On    : 10-Nov-2009 / gergely
ADN Bugzilla  : ADN46588
ADN Change ID : ORDER753: Implemented global page loading indicator for Ajax calls and page unload
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Implemented global page loading indicator: it displays a "Loading..." label (by default) with yellow 
		background and spinner in the top right corner after intercepting every:
		- DWR Ajax call
		- ExtJS Ajax call (DIV reloading in case of Logon)
		- Page unload
		The loading message can be overridden with custom messages (e.g. "Saving order...", etc) if needed by executing 
		the following JavaScript statement just right before the Ajax call: 

			loadingMessage = 'CustomLoadingText';

		This is a one-time message, after showing the label, the default "Loading..." will be automatically reverted.

		(Note: the implementation was mainly done in ORDER729, this commit is mainly the activation of the indicator)
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
