Created On    : 12-Nov-2009 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  :	46484, 44513 
ADN Change ID : ADMIN620, ORDER762,BUSINESS1439,COMMON252, PERSIST838: Truck admin lets editing composition in case no assignment
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In case there is no assignment for the truck (trailer composition, container) it is possible to change the composition on truck admin
		screen. In this case changes according to the ticket will happen to the loads.
		Pda available flag is not editable in case there is an active session for the driver. This fact will be shown on the lower part
		of the screen, together with the sooner message in case the truck has a load, and a new message will also be shown in case the truck has an
		active assignment.
		Added checks for the load updates too, do not let update the loads in case any of the related assignments are active. This will not happen
		in case of the truck admin screen as far the trailer has to be free in order to be able to attach to a truck, and it can be detached only in case
		there is no assignment.
		Replaced vlgnc_driver_pda_session view with vlgnc_driver_without_pda session because it was misleading (contains the drivers without pda session).
		Made view vlgnc_ord_item_assignment_load with the current xml. 
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
