Created On    : 12-Nov-2009 / gergely
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : TOOL002, COMMON253: Integrated the new LitDict.properties generator script into the project (full switch is not done yet!)
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Added two new Ant targets into the build file of logon-common, calling the following scripts:

		- LitDictExport.groovy: this script origins from the Vision project. Added some minor Logon specific customization: language order, 
		  filename pattern, 'howto edit' information to the top of the generated CSV (tab delimited TXT file more precisely)
		  Usage: the script is called automatically during the build process, but can be triggered manually from the logon-common directory 
		  with "adnant generatelitdict". (a sample LitDict.global file in committed in order to be able to test)

		  NOTE: in order to prevent the accidental overwriting of the static LitDict files with the new dynamic ones, the build process temporarily 
		  generates the files into logon-common/src/main/resources/tmp/  (see logon-common/build.xml line 213)

		- LitDictMigrate.groovy: this is a new script: it can migrate the content of the classis static LitDict.properties files (of Logon) to 
		  the new 'master' format (file will be called LitDictMigrated.global), with automatic grouping comments (based on the prefix of the message key) 
		  Usage: in logon-common, run "adnant migratelitdict". It will generate a file called 'LitDictMigrated.global'. 
		  This script is supposed to be used once, to migrate the old LitDict files before the "real switch" to the new format. 

		  NOTE: The input LitDict.properties files need to be alphabetically sorted before the migration, otherwise the grouping would be inefficient!
		
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M config/build.properties
M logon-common/build.xml
M logon-common/properties.xml
A logon-common/src/main/resources/LitDict.global
A logon-common/src/main/resources/LitDictExport.groovy
A logon-common/src/main/resources/LitDictMigrate.groovy

