ADN Bugzilla  : 47154
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1443, ORDER775, PERSIST843, COMMON258: Order search and monitoring authorization updates
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Before: 
		1. on order search screen: no restriction to anyone related to order statuses
		2. on order monitoring screen: order status above delivered is not visible for anyone (deleted, transmitted to bahnunternehmen(supposed bug), finished are hidden )
		After:
		1. on order search screen: 
			poolfuhrer: does not see orders in status deleted, status new 
			disposition strasse: does not see orders in status deleted, status new, transmitted to pool, trasmitted to pool ack
			everybody else, who can see the screen: no change (all statuses are available selectable)
		2. on order monitoring screen:
			poolfuhrer: does not see orders in status (deleted), new
			disposition strasse does not see orders in status (deleted), new, transmitted to pool, transmitted to pool ack
			everybody else, who can see the screen: no change except bugfix: transmitted to bahnunternehmen has to be visible
		Tehcnically authorization groups: 
		1. for order search screen:
			Group1: Should not be visible for pool/carrier admins, but anyone else (new and deleted) 
			Group2: Should be visible for pool admins (status transmitted to pool)
			Group3: Should be visible for everyone including pool/carrier admins (all other existing statuses)
		2. for order monitoring screen:
			Group1: Should not be visible for pool/carrier admins, but anyone else (new) 
			Group2: Should be visible for pool admins (status transmitted to pool)
			Group3: Should be visible for everyone (status all above and including delivered)
			(not visible to anyone: deleted, finished - they are not monitored)
