Created On    : 20-Nov-2009 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 48166, 44713, 48133
ADN Change ID : PERSIST846: order.sent_to_sap, order.NO_PDA_OR_RAIL_EVENTS_FLAG, order_item.GROSS_PRICE_MAT
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 1) sent_to_sap_ts: it is tricky to distinguish whether an
        order had been sent to SAP already or not, because truck and rail
        act different. BUT: In a few months, rail will change, and be closer
        to truck anyway!
        2) pda available flag on truck masterdata: unreliable for statistics,
        as it changes.
        3) Gross price / Rate confusion: The per ton prices was stored,
        and would act differently than the costs (where the total is stored)
        4) order_final changes: trailer.max_gross_weight missing
Description   : -
Fix           : 1) introduced order.sent_to_sap_ts, which is set exactly
        when sending to SAP (left to do)
        2) Introduced order.NO_PDA_OR_RAIL_EVENTS_FLAG which should be set
        when transmitting to truck. Can be used for rail the same way.
        3) Introduced order_item.gross_price_mat, and changed margin view
        to switch rate with this new one.
        4) updated, also with these latest changes.
Workaround    : -
