Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Usage:
		1. cd logon-common
		2. Specify the input txt file name (currently 2009-11-20_LOGON_LitDict_corrections_all.txt) in build.xml (search for the "importlitdict" target)
		3. run 'adnant importlitdict'
		4. the imported LitDict.global file will appear in the build/generated/litdict directory, the filename will have a "LitDictImported_YYYY-MM-DD_HH-mm.global" pattern
		5. take a look on the generated file (e.g. diff with our head version of LitDict.global) and if everything seems to be OK, overwrite 
		   the head version of LitDict.global with the generated file
