Created On    : 08-Dec-2009 / marton
ADN Bugzilla  : 48890
ADN Change ID : ORDER849: (multiple) soldto loading fix  
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 

in the order taking code it was assumed that exactly one 
soldto belongs to one shipto. In same rare cases this is
not true.
The code is now modified to use the soldtoId from the
shipto search result (we had it populated into the form,
just it was not used) to fetch the proper soldto.
For bimodal case a workaround is implemented: the first
soldto is used from the soldtos belonging to the 
given shipto. This is obviously not correct and need 
to be reviewed when working again on bimodal, but as
bimodal is not needed for this release this solution
is OK for the time being.

