Created On    : 14-Dec-2009 / matyas
ADN Bugzilla  : 46653
ADN Change ID : PERSIST877: base fetchmode changed back to JOIN
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : FetchMode.SELECT is used everywhere just because there are some bottlenecks for the default FecthMode.JOIN
Description   : FetchMode.SELECT is faster at the first query, but slower for the subsequent queries -> we should use FetchMode.JOIN whenever possible. FetchMode.JOIN sometimes generates too long query statement, which leads to timeout -> introduce mechanism to handle exceptions
