ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1512: Backend for automatic creation or oexecution of special orders
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The following checks are done when a wagon is set "unloaded" at a shipto:
					1. Are there any existing assignments for the wagon at the shiptos rail_chain shippingpoint with either
						special distribution dest cd (REP, xxxR) or status "loaded" and assignment_dat <= date of event -> transmit assingment to SBB
						This function handles manually created special orders (return, repair, transport)
					2. Is maintenance scheduled for the wagon -> create maintenance order, dispatch it to the wagon, set it to state "loaded", transmit to Rail company
					   (still open: set special fields of repair order)
					3. Is a automatic return order defined in shipto and wagon metadata -> create return order, dispatch it to the wagon, set it to state "loaded", transmit to Rail company

