Description   : Fatal error will not show fatalErrorform on the terminal anymore, but will direct to logout immediately
		and that will go back to login screen.
		In the log, the error is always logged just as it would be shown on the fatalerrorform.
		Moved the value of count down to TerminalActionsupport in order to be able change it easily, and have it
		at one central place.
		Changed the error messages (simple javascript alert) since it was too small. It is a simple red messagebox with 
		the normal terminal size OK button. There are no messages, just errors and warnings both on the pickup and 
		the bag terminal screens, so it was not necessary to create other than this.
		Replaced hardcoded texts on login/error/failure screens to litdict.
		On the button png there was a small white line at the bottom, which was not really intended to be there.
