Created On    : 14-Apr-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 53076
ADN Change ID : PERSIST991, COMMON332, ADMIN745, BUSINESS1585: Composition change handling differences fixed
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The problem was that the master data screen and the change truck composition handled composition
		changes differently. While the master data screen set the trailer reference of the container if
		the container was attached to the trailer+truck composition, the change truck composition did not
		set it accordingly.
		Possible consequence:max net weight could be calculated for the container only in case the trailer reference was NOT set,
		only the truck's reference, thus if the composition would be updated from the master data, actions
		asking for the compositions max tare or net weight did not consider the containers attributes,
		but in case the composition was set through changeTruckCompostion pda event, the retrieval of
		composition data may be successful, and correct, since in this case the container had only the truck reference.
		The comment tlgnc_container current_truck_id, current_trailer_id declare, that by design both
		has to be set, in case the container is attached to a trailer, and that is attached to a truck.
		Added unique constraint for current_truck_id in tlgnc_trailer and current_trailer_id, current_truck_id
		to tlgnc_container.
		What is changed: the container from all calls coming from the application asks for container primarily attached to
		the truck, and if there is no such, then that container counts also as the composition's container, which 
		is attached to the trailer - if there is one at all.
		Change truck composition event expects all the three components of the composition.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-admin-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/admin/web/actions/truckadmin/TruckAdminAction.java
M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/ChangeTruckCompositionEventHandlerImpl.java
M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/ReleaseContainerEventHandlerImpl.java
