Created On    : 03-May-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 53613
ADN Change ID : SAPSERVICE143, COMMON340: Sending hardcoded shippingpoint information in case it could not be retrieved after fallback steps
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : NO CHANGE: 
		Step 1: If the sp.known_also_in_sap_flag is true ==> use this shippingpoint anyway
		Step 2: If the sp.known_also_in_sap_flag is false
	 		a) sp.KNOWN_ALSO_IN_SAP_FLAG is false  and sp.SEND_SAP_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID is set
	    			=> uses this
	 		b) sp.KNOWN_ALSO_IN_SAP_FLAG is false, but sp.SEND_SAP_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID is null
	    			=> uses sp defined by the SHIPTO: shipto.RAIL_CHAIN_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID
  	 		c) if shipto.rail_chain_shippingpoint.KNOWN_ALSO_IN_SAP_FLAG = false
		    		=> use shipto.rail_chain_shippingpoint_it.send_sap_shippingpoint_id
		CHANGE: Step 3: If here the shippingpoint is still NULL use the shippingpoint retrieved for sap_shippingpoint_no=S034 (currently rail siggenthal). In these cases:
			- sp.known_also_in_sap_flag is false and sp.SEND_SAP_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID is null AND shipto.RAIL_CHAIN_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID NOT SET
			- sp.known_also_in_sap_flag is false and sp.SEND_SAP_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID is null AND shipto.RAIL_CHAIN_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID.known_in_sap_flag is false and shipto.RAIL_CHAIN_SHIPPINGPOINT_ID.send_sap_shippingpoint is NULL
		Exception is thrown only in case this shippingpoint with sap_shippingpoint_no S034 is not present in the db.
		All shippingpoint dependent data is going to be sent according to the shippingpoint determined in this process!
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
