Created On    : 11-May-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 53976, 54078
ADN Change ID : ORDER1109, BUSINESS1619: Removing check for actual delivery dat of bimodal rail part, visible wagon no, startload fix for container terminal case
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1. Till now if the actual delivery dat was NOT before the current time, the bimodal road part was not editable. From now
		it is editable depending only on the status of the related bimodal rail part. 
		2. Till now the bimodal road order was editable only if the related rail part was in status arrived at unloading point, 
		unloading,delivered. From now the requirement is status arrived at unloading point, unloading, delivered and FINISHED as well.
		3. Startload was not called in case of container terminal case. This does not make too much difference, but it is not
		consistent with the pda flow where it is as startload + scansilo + endload, besides there may be a lack of startload outgoing message
		which is designed to precede the endload message.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
