ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1620: Correction of BUSINESS1618
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : At truck unloading at container terminal:
					- unlink container from truck/trailer
					- unlink load from truck/trailer
					- set order to unloaded (normal order processing)
					- don't set load's unloading_ts (will be set when container is loaded on other truck)
				On wagon unloading at container terminal:
					- unlink container from wagon
					- don't unlink load from wagon (so that it stays visible in wagon's past loads)
					- set order to delivered
					- don't set load's unloading_ts (will be set when container is loaded on other truck)
