Created On    : 18-May-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 54179
ADN Change ID : ADMIN762, BUSINESS1635: Checking active assignment 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Check if the container has active assignment changed:
		until now: all loads, which were loaded but not yet unloaded, and had active assignment were considered
			active, and therefore in this case changing its composition was prevented
		from now: all loads, which were loaded but not yet unloaded, and had active assignment, and have either truck or
			wagon id, and the current compositions truck and wagon corresponds with the loads truck or wagon_id are considered
			active therefore if there is such, changing composition will be prevented
		Updating of loads:
		Original cause was that if there is a container, it must be possible to detach it TOGETHER with the load, and later attach
		to a trailer or truck/trailer, wagon composition. 
		until now: loads, which were loaded but not yet unloaded were updated with the current composition
		from now: loads, which were loaded but not yet unloaded, and are not a reference to any of the other loads to be updated
			will be updated with the current composition
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/TruckAdminServiceBean.java

