Created On    : 26-May-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 54496
ADN Change ID : TERMINAL036, BUSINESS1644, ORDER1124: In pickup bulk case assignment is immediately created for the order, and sent to parallel
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : As far pickup bulk orders mean that the customer will go to the parallel terminal with a parallel badge, and
		pick the order up there, the orders placed either on webbestellung, call center must be transmitted to
		the parallel system right at creation time.
		Therefore creating a pickup bulk order will include the steps: create assignment and transmit to the truck/parallel.
		Due to this change there is no need to use the dispo screen for pickup bulk orders, as far that is already done
		right when the order is created, but the shipping screen can handle the pickup bulk order, as far it is already in state
		transmitted to truck. 
		Terminal screen does not restrict editing based on the dispatch sequence. (it does restrict for normal bulk orders - if an order
		is planned before another then the later one is not editable until the sooner is loaded).
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
