Description   : The problem was the following: The D-Zement sales area had no selectable
		bill-to, thus the saved order had an empty bill-to value and it was recognized (incorrectly) by the app 
		as a dummy order. (Reason: a long time ago, dummy orders were identified by having a zero rate and/or empty 
		bill-to (and these dummy orders were displayed in a separate category) In the meanwhile, this logic has 
		been changed and an order creation type field is used to mark the dummy orders, so checking the bill-to and rate is not
		necessary anymore. I removed this buggy bill-to filter.)
