Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Until now only P48 and P40 units counted as pallet uoms. This means only these could be ordered
		in a way that the customer is charged for the pallets taken away (plus order items Euro-Palletten).
		As far P56, P42 and BIG new uoms are also pallets, they must also be considered to add charge to the order
		in case they are not returned.
		Orderdetail also did not know about these uoms.
		In BagTErminalServiceBean, nullpointer fixed see 54780. Besides made possible to cope with 
		orders where services are also present in the order.
