ADN Bugzilla  : 55310
ADN Change ID : ORDER1143: Order special popup used gross weight of previous and current load instead of net weight
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : When creating a special order for a certain wagon (wagon detail/create special order popup) with current or previous 
		load, the new special orders ordered quantity field got the gross weight instead of the loaded net weight. Therefore
		on rail dispo at ordered measure the gross weight of the previous/current load was shown. See screenshot in ticket.
Description   : The net weight was set as tare+net instead of pure net data. From now it will be set to net quantity of the previous/current load.
		Tare weight will still remain empty, see the issue described in ticket 55310. (From previous, and current load it would be clear what tare weight to use
		for the new load, but for the manuelle material load there is neither a plus tare weight field to type the tare weight in,
		nor a previous load to take the tare weight from. For the moment agreed that this will remain so (null). SAP alo uses net weight
		according to latest information.
