Created On    : 02-Jul-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 56047
ADN Change ID : SAPSERVICE146, PERSIST1025: Added new field distribution_channel to condition tables, changed sap import, updated pricing condition xsd and testcases to use it
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The new field VTWEG is to transmit distribution_channel attributes for transport or material conditions. Optional, 2 characters long.
		In order to have the new field's value we needed to change the xsd, regenerate the wsdl, create table script (for what the generation is
		not deterministic, therefore we need to check its content first). 
		From side of logon we needed the two new fields (added to patch) and the new field VTWEG in the staging area table PRICINGCONDITIONSREQDT.
		In the import we needed to add the mapping of the new field, which does not need a lookup, can directly be added to the condition tables.
		The patch_1.4.0_sap.sql needs to be executed as sap user.
		Test requests run successfully, the tables got the value if it was given, they received null if it was missing, or the field was not at all
		present in the request. Updated test requests with the new field.
