Created On    : 07-Jul-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 56044
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1029: Added brans_sales_name and handling of the is new field in pdf generation
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In delivery note brand_sales_name (new field in tlgnc_mat_plant - plant + sap_material_id dependent but language independent)
		overrides the tlgns_sap_material_description entry (language dependent but independent from plant_cd) of the material.
		Reason: for NGE the description is of course imported from SAP, but contains additional information about the product, which
		is not really intended to be shown on the delivery note, therefore NGE needed the field to override the value coming from 
		SAP, but only in delivery note!
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
