Created On    : 13-Jul-2010 / szilagyi
ADN Bugzilla  : 55905
ADN Change ID : ADMIN766, BUSINESS1681, PERSIST1034, WSCLIENT085: Create file and save on an ftp server
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The TransmitToSapJob from the admin-web calls the transmitToSap service. The transmitToSap decides about the orders that if they NGE order or not.
		It collects the NGE orders into a list, and transmit the list to the transmitToNge(List ngeList). The transmitToNge was placed into a new class called OrderDeliveryNGEServiceBean.
		The file creation and the FTP sending procedure is in this new class. It creates the new file into a local directory and after this sends it to the remote FTP server.
		The NGEOrderSapDataBean and the NGEOrderItemSapDataBean are auto-generated beans. They store the necessary data about an order and an order item.
		The OrderSapDateServiceBean sets up these beans. The fields of the NGEOrderSapDataBean and the NGEOrderItemSapDataBean are the contents of the flat file.

Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
