Created On    : 20-Jul-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 57002
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1043: Added new column plant_cd to tlgns_sap_mat_cond renamed sap_shippingpoint_no alias of werks attribute to plant_cd
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Werks parameter contains the plant_cd not sap_shippingpoint_no. It was not used at all in CH SAP import,
		sap_shippingpoint_no was (and is still) retrieved from additional field ZZVSTEL. The field WERKS is now used
		for NGE, 1. we receive the plant_cd there, and we look up the sap_shippingpoint_no according to that, 2. in the 
		tlgns_sap_mat_cond now there is a plant_cd field, which is going to be used to in order taking to restrict supply
		plant. Therefore renamed to plant_cd alias as far now it is definitely used for plant purposes as not shippingpoint. Until
		now it was not worth to change as far it was not used for anything, but now it would be misleading to leave
		the werks alias as sap_shippingpoint_no.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
