Created On    : 29-Jul-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 57481
ADN Change ID : PARALLEL072, ORDERMGR049, BUSINESS1696: Parallel will not accept calls where the shippingpoint does not have parallel spid
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Parallel will not accept calls where the loadingpoint and therefore the sp is known, and is not parallel, it will throw exception.
		Necessary to prevent such cases where the parallel service silently deleted for example load_order_id.
		Order service will NOT call parallel service if it knows for sure that it would fail there (because does not have spid). From other sources
		we only supposed that it cannot even happen that it will be called with shippingpoint without parallel spid.
		No change in order service, where until now the call of parallel service depended  on the type of the loadingpoint.
		For a loadingpoint with type parallel is guaranteed by the master data functionality that a parallel spid must 
		exist, there is no need for adding further conditions.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
