ADN Change ID : PERSIST1069: Initial DB creation for NGE (first shot).
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Idea currently is:
		- take a prod CHE DB
		- drop all FK, truncate all "data" tables (but not refdata), recreate FK
		- call scripts to fill data with user data + initialdata for NGE
Description   : Alternative would be:
		Create DB from scratch, with create sql scripts, load also all refdata,
		then load all initialdata.
		There are advantages & disadvantages of this approach, and it's probably
		worth to implement & test both, because it shows a few errors which
		should be fixed anyway.
Fix           : - Fixed duplicate names for FK (why were those not detected in
		prod until now)
		- Moved vendor/carrier for NGE from minimal_setup to initialdata_load_NGE
		- Added a first truck
		- Added a set of initial users.
