Created On    : 20-Sep-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 56457, 56544
ADN Change ID : TERMINAL041, BUSINESS1746, COMMON388: Free of charge delivery for pickup and printing delivery note changes for pickup
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Free of charge delivery for pickup. Until now it was not possible to create free of charge order on the touchscreen terminal
		even though the dispokarte defined that it should be free of charge. From now if the dispokarte defines that an item is
		free of charge, the order will be free of charge, but it will not be possible to add other materials, which would not be free.
		So only free of charge materials can be added to a free of charge order. Besides in case the order is free of charge the soldto
		has to correspond with the billto (oversall rule on webbestellung, call center).
		Print delivery note change. Until now the last step executed when clicking print delivery note was that a pdf had been generated 
		and printed. Problem was that if the flag DELIVNOTE_PAPER_FLAG was set on the dispokarte, a delivery note was anyway printed 
		at endload, thus twice as much delivery notes had been printed as desired.
		From now 1. the flag DELIVNOTE_PAPER_FLAG will be automatically set to TRUE when the endload is called from the touchscreen terminal, and thus it is
		guaranteed that the delivery note is going to be printed, and the flag will also sign that it had been printed 2. generate and print is
		not done anymore at the end.
		Overall change in pdf. In case the realstart is not known, always sign that the delivery time is yet uncertain with a ~ sign. In case of pickup 
		do NOT print a delivery time at all.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/BagTerminalServiceBean.java
