Created On    : 05-Oct-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 58873
ADN Change ID : MOP377, BUSINESS1768, ORDER1204: Changes related to carrier stock
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Loadingpoint list sent to pda was always retreived for the order shippingpoint, and therefore
        PDA got the wrong loadingpoint list at the carrier stock. From now if the load assignment
        part's shippingpoint does not correspond with the orders shippingpoint (and therefore it is
        supposed to be served from somewhere else) the loadingpoint list will only contain the one and
        single loadingpoint available there, or send empty list if none available. Loadingpoint restrictions
        are not considered at all, since on order level only the distance and duration is changed according
        to the new shippingpoint, price, and such does not change. If there is a loadingpoint, and is alone, that is sent.
        At sending to SAP the Distance_Calculated_M attribute of the truck route (between the ORIGINAL shippingpoint and the shipto)
        stored at order creation time will be used, because SAP is interested in that, and not the real distance.
        There is no check for being carrier stock assignment, if the assignment load part's shippingpoint
        differs from the original order shippingpoint, this rule will be applied, as far the order had been created for
        the shippingpoint, it was just served from somewhere else.
        In freeze order there is no change, it will still reflect the reality, and freeze that.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/AsyncMopEventOutServiceBean.java
