Created On    : 21-Oct-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 61321
ADN Change ID : ORDER1223: External order workflow if entershipto step had been skipped run it at startunload or endunload
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Unloading parts timestamp is set when the truck enters the shipto. If this step was skipped 
		the timestamp was left empty. Do the same as normal workflow does, if the step is skipped, run it automatically
		at startunload or endunload.
		As far the normal workflow bases the decision to follow the steps of entershipto on the order status,
		the external order status changes had also been added to these steps, and the decision is also based
		on the external order status.
		Entershipto - arrived at unloading point, startunload - unloading state changes had been added.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
