Created On    : 27-Oct-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 61761
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1793, CUST141, ORDER1228, TERMINAL047, PERSIST1135: Added commercial_distance_m to tlgnc_order
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Basically has the same role as transport_distance_m until the case of carrier stock assignments.
		From that point we need to store the original distance on the order, since transport_distance_m
		is supposed to reflect the reality (distance between the carrier stock and the delivery point), and
		therefore it is updated when the order is dispached.
		SAP needs the original value. Updated all places where transport_distance_m was set
		this new field is also set initially.
		To SAP this new field's value is going to be sent, the field is used only there.
		The field is going to be initialized to the value of the transport_distance_m, as far for most cases
		it will always correspond to that (added to the patch).
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
