Created On    : 08-Nov-2010 / boon
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : SETUP114: Build changes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1) Updated to GDI v1.0.19.0 and GDI-JPA v1.0.22.0
		2) Changed all ant gdi java-tasks to gditasks.
		3) Build-Date and Build-Stamp in the manifests are fixed if building in the dev environment. Otherwise the JAR will be rebuild after a minute regardless of any changes in the content.
		4) Removed the 3 second sleep between generating LAN and DMZ configuration. Instead, building 2 wars seperately.
		5) Included an update-check for logon-common which excludes changes in buildtime.properties.
		6) Removed buildtime.properties from the webprojects, as it's being found on the classpath, it should be sufficient to be available in logon-common.
		5) Included several up-to-date-checks in logon-common, logon-webservice-mop-incoming, logon-webservices-pws-incoming.
		6) Don't copy soapui testclient to local folder, I don't see it being used anywhere.
		7) Don't delete ${dist.dep.dir} in the web projects anymore, it is not necessary and if it is, we should find out why.
		8) Don't create LAN configuration for logon-terminal, it's not used.
		9) Removed testclient generation in logon-webservice-mop-incoming, logon-webservices-pws-incoming.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
