ADN Bugzilla  : 62198
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1143, BUSINESS1801, CUST142, ORDER1236, ORDERMGR052,TERMINAL049, DISPO318: Handling of services
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Services are now handled transparent from the assignment point of view, it does not have loading 
		assignment part, and load anymore. 
		Due to this change the external systems will not have any clue about the service item(s), and they will not
		receive the service item at all. There is no load procedure for service items, but when the order gets to status
		delivered their delivered field will simly be updated with the ordered fields.
		PERSIST: Added comments to the tables, added new logon package type for services (S004 and S005 is mapped to that)
		BUSINESS1801, ORDERMGR052: Where order items are retrieved, and it is in the workflow, only the
		material items are returned back as far the workflow has to know only about those.
		CUST142, ORDER1236: Call center and order taking from now allows adding of service(s) to bag and bulk orders
		DISPO318: In rail dispo the service item should not be considered in most cases (such as determining the matching order
		preload, etc.)
