Created On    : 19-Nov-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 62875
ADN Change ID : ORDERMGR053, PERSIST1144: Changing sequence of sending and freezing when setting order to finishes 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : PersistenceException thrown was caught by the catch block in _setToFinished, but in the meantime
		the transaction had been rolled back! In the meantime the message has been sent to SAP. As a result
		order was sent again and again to SAP since it remained in status delivered in logon.
		The real cause was in fact that the order's contact_person_txt was too long to be saved to order finals
		corresponding field.
Description   : Sending to SAP is from now the last step, in case freezing fails, the order is NOT sent to SAP, and 
		in case sending fails it rolls back the changes in logon db too.
Fix           : Naturally added to the patch the statement which updates the o_contact_person_txt to be able to be used
		to save contact_person_txt of tlgnc_order.
