Created On    : 29-Nov-2010 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 56687, 62160, 63096
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1147, BUSINESS1802, ORDER1238: Rail return order (single service item in an order) changes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : As far rail return orders, maintenance orders are pure service orders, the previous changes which
		supposed that such orders cannot be handled had to be updated to be able to handle those as well.
		In the meantime the orders present in the db are such service orders, which DO HAVE loading part, and
		load, so in order to be able to be compatible with the orders present in the db the the order items which
		have a load will be considered as material items (even if they are services) to be handled like normal material items.
		Thus the assignment parts, loads will be updated successfully when setting to delivered, but next time an order
		is created with such a service item, there will be no load, and no loading part, so it will be considered as
		service item, and no load related updates will happen. "Open" loads and "open" loading assignment parts
		related to service items will disappear gradually from the db.
		Removed wagon_detail_order_list view, in fact it was not needed, since the order list had been removed
		long time ago from wagon detail screen.
		Change in vlgnc_wagon_search. As far in case of special rail assignments the real start of the loading part had been
		set when it was created, and from now for services it will not be existing at all, in the wagon search the
		return orders were not visible for wagons. Therefore updated the joined tlgnc_assignment to retrieve the first assignment
		ordered by planned start.
		In vlgnc_dispo_rail_ass_list wagons would be missing in case the load part is inner joined, therefore from now on it is
		only an outer join, and the drive to part is inner joined. The shippingpoint is also retrieved from the drive to part
		instead of the loading part (which does not exist anymore for services).
		Changes in vlgnc_wagon_detail_assignment. See bug 63096. As far the shippingpoint was retrieved from the load 
		assignment part, which is from now missing for return orders NPE was thrown. From now drive-to part's shippingpoint will
		be retrieved as shippnigpoint of the rail order.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-admin-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/admin/web/actions/masterdata/AbstractWagonDetailAction.java
