ADN Change ID : SETUP120: Clean up webservice projects
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Another step in the process of turning off the jboss shared
		classloader:
		- Changes packaging of webapps, classes are in the WAR directly
		instead of in JARs, common-web classes/resources are
		copied/merged into the WARs.
		- Logon-init is not dependent on Struts anymore (even though it
		contains some unused Struts-dependent classes from common-web).
		- webservices-pws, -mop are properly initialized using Spring
		now, Log4j is not included anymore, the container's JAR is used.
		logon-webservices needs to be changes as well, but the ejb
		component has a pervert dependency on common-web
		(ServiceLocatorProvider).
