Created On    : 28-Dec-2010 / boon
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticket/ADN63933
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1821: Report based on tlgnc_load
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : This change only adds the LP to tlgnc_load.
		1) The DB patch will copy the LP from order_item to load for all
		loads with loading_ts <> null. This way, all existing loads will
		be updated with the actual LP.
		2) The patch will rename the column 'OI_LOADINGPOINT_ID' to
		'LOAD_LOADINGPOINT_ID' in the TLGNF_ORDER_ITEM_FINAL table. This
		means that only the actual LP will be frozen, not the planned
		LP.
		3) The planned LP is set at order taking (as is).
		4) Transmit to PDA/transmit to Parallel use the 'planned' LP (as
		is).
		5) The actual LP is set at startLoad/endLoad on the load.
		6) The following screens will use the actual LP from the load,
		and not the LP from the order item:
		a) Terminal screen (LP is set after storing new weights).
		b) Order details. This screen will show the actual LP if it is
		set, otherwise it will show the planned LP. The LP can only be
		edited when the order is not dispatched yet (as is), only the
		planned LP can be changed.
		c) Assignment edit and order monitoring will use the actual LP
		to calculate the loading time.
		d) Live karte used the actual LP for filtering orders. 
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/BagTerminalServiceBean.java
