Created On    : 06-Jan-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 62159, 62879
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1160, ORDER1258, COMMON417, ADMIN812, BUSINESS1825: Wagon detail buttons from order detail, reloading of call center lists change
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Wagon detail: 
		1. New buttons delete, set delivered, and the new checkbox railholdbackreorder flag on order.
		2. Related persist changes: in the naming was not consistent with tlgnc_shipto.rail_hold_back_re_order_flag, therefore
		renamed and added rail_ to the hold_back etc. therefore needed change in the view committed sooner, and change 
		in the patch.
		3. From wagondetailmain moved the order related attributes to a new bean WagonDetailCurrentOrderBean, the new flag is
		present there.
		4. Load tab: readded tare column, which shows the tare_quantity of the load, but tare measure column remained also there
		In order detail: 
		1. logic to enable, disable, the buttons delete order, and set delivered
		must be common with the logic on wagon detail, moved the logic from the jsp to a tag, which is common used 
		by wagon detail and order detail.
		2. The delete functionality of order detail had been partly moved to the orderservicebean, in order to be able to call it
		from both sources.
		3. Call center lists are not loaded in orderdetailaction anymore, they are moved to the call center action, since they belong
		there. The refresh should only be done in case the call center screen is in the background, not from all screens.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
