Created On    : 28-Jan-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : TEST269: Changed pda workflow sequence
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Until now: test-pda-workflow1 was OrderCreationTest, and the second target
		test-pda-workflow-part2 was waiting for the transmit to parallel event.
		From the log it seemed that the OrderCreationTest run so long that the 
		second part gave up the waiting. Therefore separated order creation and dispatching
		and from now part0 is order creation, and part 1 is dispathcing, which is still parallel
		run with the test-pda-workflow-part2 (waitingLKWVerladeAuftragNeu until it gets).

		Added SAP data verification to OrderVerificationTest. Just checking if fields supposed
		to be filled in after finishing an order are not empty, their value is not really checked.
		OrderCreationTest, OrderDispatchingTest, and OrderVerificationTest from now use the file 
		etc/workflow.properties, and the soapui also reads that.
		
		Change in integration-tests-soapui-project. Since 'report based on load' the pda receives
		anyway a tour data after loginToParallel, and the soapui test failed becuase of this, since it
		was waiting for loadigStarted instead of tour data. The test had to be adjusted to 
		pda workflow therefore: added a preceding step in front of loadingStarted, 
		waitForTourDataAfterLoginToParallel.
		Setting back waiting time changed yesterday, since it did not help.

		Change in testdata.properties. Since there is no guarantee that the PIN is always 1234 for the user
		currently in testdata.properties, only the testdata user, changing back to this user.

		OrderDeliveryTestCase is simply delivering an empty message checking the order delivery functionality.
		Added setting of required fields.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

