Created On    : 11-Mar-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 67021
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1872: Locking in customs notification number service is from now on outside of the transactions
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : A db timeout which lasts longer than the timeout set in jboss-service.xml caused a full stop of the application.
Description   : In case this timeout had been reached becuase a transaction took more than the prescribed time, the application 
		lock was not released anymore. The timeout can be reached easily in case the db timeout is longer
		than this transaction timeout, and therefore the other thread keeps the lock for the db timeout time.
		As soon as the semaphore had been released, the thread which was waiting 
		for this release threw an exception, and kept the lock from that point on causing the stop.
Fix           : TransactionAttributeType.NOT_SUPPORTED because it lets to be called from a transaction and
		also from the order detail action. As a result the timeout does not hold for the code part where waiting
		for the lock release.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/CustomsNotificationNumberServiceBean.java

