Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Master data, global settings, zone map tab. When one changes a polygons zone, and this polygon has been added latest
		(TRSP_ZONE_POLYGON_ID is higher than any of the other polygon rows which have the same zone setting when loading) then 
		all those other polygons will be updated to have this zone setting.
		In case one changes a polygon, which is not the latest, and changes the zone_cd for it, the change is ignored, and is
		not saved in db.
