Created On    : 21-Mar-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 67691
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1880: Do not try to convert service units in case they are in the base uom
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : There was an error logged every time a conversion happened from the ordered uom to the base uom in case of service
		materials. The error appeared many times, because of the fact that empty wagons count as service items, and they are defined as fuzzy
		with uom_dimension_cd TO, which seems to be a specification gap, but SAP defines them so. For this time 
		the fix is the simplest possible, do not convert in case the two uoms are equal if they are services . (Did not moved it
		to the LogonUtil method, becuase at other places the role of calling this function is not only getting the converted value, 
		but to fail in case the uom at that point is fuzzy (delivered uom should not be fuzzy).
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
