Created On    : 09-Jun-2011 / nemes
ADN Bugzilla  : ADN71461
ADN Change ID : SAPSERVICE211: SAP IMPORT: Change called cron job name in SAP import
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : There are two aspects of this change:
			1) naming of sap import cron jobs
			2) prefixing table name annotations in entity beans

		From now on these two will match:
			1) cronjob name: sapimport_$tableprefix
			2) table name: $tableprefix_*

		Naming scheme is controlled from:
			logon-webservices/etc/cfg/sap_abbrev.properties
		...and used by the adnant targets:
			generate-entities generateServices 

		Current naming scheme:
			BusinessPartnerNotification=bpn
			CreditStatusNotification=csn
			MaterialNotification=mn
			PriceConditionNotification=pcn
			PurchasingDocument=pd
			SalesDocumentNotification=sdn
			VehicleNotification=vehn
			VendorNotification=vn

		Please note, while "generate-entities" target will fail if
		there is a missing mapping (java code exception, fails subant),
		the "generateServices" target will not fail (GDI template SapServiceBean_4all)
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
