Created On    : 29-Jul-2011 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : 73543
ADN Change ID : TEST317: Testdata for contracts/bp/mat independent of CHE
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Until now, all tests always relied on well maintained
		CHE data (from production Holcim). This is not a path that
		can be followed for EBM.
		Even worse: The French data will not be available in CHE later,
		i.e., to develop additional functionality at LOGON in 1-2 years,
		we would have to switch between 4 DB all the time. Testing
		nightmare!
Description   : Idea is: ALL testdata must be SELF-CONSTRUCTED, and we
		are able to PROOF that the functionality is working on that
		data. With the data we document how we understand it, and how
		this works, and what combinations exist.
		Only rare cases would require real data from production.
Fix           : Constructed a set of contracts based on well known
		CHE materials and shiptos. Then, mapped to a range not used
		by any DB (-> negative IDs!).
		Limitations currently:
		- Still rely on CHE plants, CHE sorg, CHE sarea, ...
		  For this, DEFINE variables have been introduced. Update
		  them in a suitable way for ADZA structures (and later
		  also for FBNL if wanted).
		- Not yet many records (quite time consuming)
		- Not yet all cases.
		- Not yet integrated in the DB-setup scripts.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
