ADN Bugzilla  : ADN74858
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1996, ORDER1380: Remove usage of transport and material conditions
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : * Material price calculation was broken for additional
		materials. (The original code stored the the list price
		string in OrderTakingEditorDto.sapMatPrice for every
		material, which probably worked before, but I did not
		like that solution, it looked like hacking.)
		* If contract does not give information about pricing,
		display "n.a." consistently again everywhere in
		the Call Center (New Order Editor and order lists).
		* As agreed with Emoke: for now disabled the check
		that does not allow ordering a material without
		pricing information, because that check was for
		material conditions.
