Created On    : 02-Sep-2011 / boon
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticket/ADN73940
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS1997: Authorization by Company Code
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Removed mapping for shipto.getShiptoSalesAreas to force
		authorization when retrieving shiptosareas. This led to a few
		changes in Dispokarte/Order taking behavior:
		- WAS: shipto was created in order
		taking/dispokarte/webbestellung if it didn't exist.
		- WAS: shiptosareas were created in order taking/dispokarte if
		none existed.
		- WAS: additional shiptosareas were only added in dispokarte (if
		other shiptosareas already existed for the shipto).
		- IS: shipto is only created in order taking/dispokarte.
		- IS: shiptosareas are updated/added always in order
		taking/dispokarte.
		- IS: only those shiptosareas are added for which the user has
authorization.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
