		  tlgns_sap_contract.quality_control_flag is set but
		  tlgns_sap_contract_item.{target_quantity,
		  target_quantity_uom_cd} are not, log that inconsistency
		  as an error, and do not include that contract item in
		  the calculation. Fixes possible NullPointerExceptions.
		  (This was conducted rather theoretically than tested.)
