Created On    : 12-Oct-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 75930
ADN Change ID : COMMON493, ORDER1450: Dispo screen now shows the revenue per truck for all assignments
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The assumption that we only have to show the freight cost in case the assignemnt is already released
		was the base to load the trucks, and together with them the 'freezed' prescheduling data.
		From now on the truck shows the sum of all assignments loaded together with prescheduling info,
		there is no separate query for the revenue per truck. The cause is that the truck list knows nothing 
		about the assignments and orders, and it is not intended to join anything there. The information
		for the orders assigned to the truck is already available, there is no need to query it again.
