Created On    : 13-Oct-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 74878
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2070, PERSIST1451, ORDER1452: Removing default shipto sarea restriction
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In Logon 1.6 default restrictions were symbolized with a simple restriction with 
		sap_material_id null. In case this entry existed, that had a special meaning regarding
		the available materials in order taking. If present, also materials which were not configured
		on dispokarte were available. If not present, only materials predefined on dispokarte
		should have been visible. In Logon EBM this distinction is not implemented (yet?). If it will be
		it will probably not modeled with a special restriction, but differently, like a flag on the 
		sales area.
		The availability of bag/bulk in combination with restrictions is also missing in the current 
		version, but is not ment to be solved with special restrictions.
		Persist: removing the creation of default restriction, patch: deleting all of them, and making
		the column not nullable.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
