Created On    : 13-Oct-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 74878, 76835
ADN Change ID : ORDER1453, BUSINESS2071: Material descriptions loaded for the silos of the shipto
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In Logon 1.6 material descriptions were commonly  loaded. From Logon 2.0.x only
		loaded the descriptions of the materials which qualified somehow either from a contract
		or from the sales area, and are available.
		In the silo dropdown materials are loaded for the sales area, therefore the description map
		loaded for the restrictions and available materials is not sufficient. Separated
		the loading of these material descriptions.
		Silos can be added both on order taking and dispokarte. To avoid code duplication added the
		loader function to the class they both extend OrderActionSupport.
		From DispokarteForm deleted several unused lists, maps: 
		materialDescriptionMap (until now was used to resolve the description of materials both on the silo
			and also on sales area tab parts, but it needs now a separation see above). As for the material
			descriptions coming as delivery settings they are already resolved and contain the description
			information, there is no need to store it in a map).
		materialPackageTypeTxMap: used by the default restriction removed in commit ORDER1452
		packageTypeTxMap: used by the default  restriction removed in commit ORDER1452
		dummySelectedDeliveryType: probably never used anywhere
		uomMap: most likely was used sooner for showing uom descriptions, but that is now solved by DeliverySettingOptionConfiguration
		packingTypeList: did not find the usage
		distributionDestinationList: did not find the usage
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
