Created On    : 21-Oct-2011 / boon
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/ticket/ADN73181
ADN Change ID : SETUP135: wsdump tracing: Provide some means to filter more precisely
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : An xpath expression can be configured per web service to
                determine if the dump should NOT be saved. Also, the result of
                an xpath expression can be used in the filename of the dump
                file.
                Currently it's configured as follows:
                - For PDA messages dumping of geoevents is disabled.
                - Other PDA messages are stored in incoming-mop/<date>/<hour>
                - SAP messages are stored in incoming-sap/<date>/<sap service>,
                  this way it's possible to distinguish the message type by it's
                  directory.
                - Parallel truck messages are stored in
                  incoming-parallel-truck/<date>
                - Parallel rail messages are stored in
                  incoming-parallel-rail/<date>
                - LogonServices messages are stored in
                  incoming-<clientType>/<date>, for example
                  incoming-wewas-nge/<date>
                - LogonOrderServices messages are stored in
                  incoming-<clientType>/<date>, for example
                  incoming-fenics/<date>
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
