ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : TEST379: Adapted dispokarte and order taking to the contract based UIs
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Order data now stores the contract number and item number, in order to be able to select it.
		These are only the first steps in order to be able to try to create customer order etc. (different
		type orders).
		There was a little confusion about Keys and saved properties, named as labels from now on which are not 
		really keys.
		In the soapui projects logonOrderNumber was not set, not retrieved from the order data request, and the shipto
		id was also not used from the order data therefore it caused failure.
		In test data added a pda for the test user james bond which we use in the integration script, but with a swiss
		pda number. Updated the pda device number in all related fields of the integration tests to use this pda
		instead of the non existent swiss one.
		Logging in should not be a property of the workflow.
		For shippingpoints we would need parallel spid test values, because name.dotternhausen, siggenthal etc. is naturallally
		not configured in the dev environment, and sending to the parallel system fails because of that.
