Created On    : 03-Nov-2011 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : 77286, 77213
ADN Change ID : ORDER1466, BUSINESS2092, COMMON498: Order detail plant and shippingpoint dropdowns - same content as on OT
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Order detail changes (ticket 77286)
		Part 1: Supply plant options

		Until now: plants shown on order detail: all, which are active. 
		From now on: all which are available for selection as a delivery plant on OT (and dispokarte as well).
		
		Rules from now: 
		1. plants, which are associated with the material through sap material-plant connection (tlgns_sap_material_plant)
		2. plants, which are granted to be used within the sales area of the order, associated with the sales area through plant sales area connection (tlgnc_plant_sarea)
		3. plants, which are active
		4. SPECIAL: plant of the shippingpoint stored on the order is always selectable, even if it is invalid. In the meantime when saving it, there
		is a warning showing that it is in fact invalid.

		Part 1: Shippingpoint options:
		
		Until now: all shippingpoints available for the selected plant. 
		From now on: all which are available for selection as shippingpoint on OT (and dispokarte as well).
    
		Rules from now:
		1. Shippingpoint type matches the order's delivery type 
		    road shippingpoint - only for road delivery available
		    rail shippingpoint - available for rail, and bimodal rail delivery,
		    fvl bimodal truck - only available for bimodal road delivery
		    container shippongpoint only available for bimodal road
		    for pickup no limitation
		2. SPECIAL: The shippingpoint stored on the order is always is always selectable, even if it is invalid. In the meantime when saving it, there
		is a warning showing that it is in fact invalid.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

