ADN Bugzilla  : 77213
ADN Change ID : COMMON499: Validation errors should block order creation
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In ITC1 validation was activated, but in case of an error did not block the usage.
		In ticket 77213 it was explicitely requested to forbid saving in case the order is invalid.
		From now on, the common validation which takes place when saving a new order
		will cause refusal of order creation in case any validation error steps up.
		(Until now it was just a message, but did not block the order creation). The only place where the validation
		errors should not ever cause failure is order detail, where it is guaranteed 
		that they do not block the saving.
