ADN Bugzilla  : ADN78105
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1474 : removed block fixme's, fixed BAHNS decoding
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : there were fixme's for handling AUFSD, LIFSD and SPERR values
	handling of railway station not yet adopted to logon ebm -> import fails if railway station specified in request
Description   : -
Fix           : fixme's for AUFSD, LIFSD and SPERR removed, implementation is according spec
	railway station is handled as follows: BAHNS, if and only if 8 characters long, is decoded into:
		country code - first 2 characters
		railway station number - remaining 6 characters
	the lookup is then done as before
	tested with: too short BAHNS, missing BAHNS, correct BAHNS (with successful lookup and with unsuccessful lookup)
Workaround    : -
