Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : As payer partners are supposed to be handled similar to billto, there is no need to
		apply user restrictions on them. The sold-to business partner is first authorized, or denied
		for the user.
		Application of company code filter does not have to take place, sales area is anyway authorized 
		through the sold-to partners sales area first, so sales area filter is either not necessary to be
		applied. (Just like for tlgnc_shipto_billto which is loaded for the shipto sales area).
		
		Summary: absolutely no filter is applied for VLGNS_SAP_SOLD_PAY_SAREA_SRCH for any user.
