Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : SPNEGO/jboss-negotiation (kerberos) not working with windows 7 clients
Description   : various issues, described in detail in 71381
Fix           : config/build.properties
< JBOSS_NEGOTIATION_HOME=${EXT_PROJ_DIR}/jboss/jboss-negotiation/2.0.3-Beta1
---
> JBOSS_NEGOTIATION_HOME=${EXT_PROJ_DIR}/jboss/jboss-negotiation/2.0.3.SP3-brew
				pkg/logonlan/build.xml:
<                               <include name="jboss-negotiation.jar"/>
---
>                               <include name="jboss-security-negotiation.jar"/>
Workaround    : replacing jboss-negotiation.jar with jboss-security-negotiation.jar 
		Already done this in CH prod (oct 2011) and quality (july 2011).
