ADN Change ID : TERMINAL064, BUSINESS2105, ORDER1478: 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : From Logon 2.0 the shipto search does not make sure that the shipto sales areas loaded do have
		soldto sales areas (and partner functions in the sales area) in the background.
		Therefore when loading the shipto sales areas only those shipto sales areas have to be loaded
		which have a corresponding entry in the Logon 1.6 view VLGNS_SOLDSHIP_SAREA_FLEX_SRCH. (This view
		makes sure that that the partner functions within the retrieved sales areas are present).

		Tested with the shipto specified in the ticket. Did not test (due to lack of available data)
		what if there is other sold-to for which the sales area is present. In this case the shipto sales area
		is only supposed to be updated/created when the other sold-to + ship-to combination is opened.
