Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Usage of former carrier field has to be updated to separated to usage of commercial and executing carrier. See also ticket descriptions.
 
		Order taking sources: 
		    Wewas: setting both carriers immediately
		    Fenics: FIXME not yet specified, currently if specified, do not overwrite, if empty, set the truck's carrier both to executing and commercial carrier.
			    Open item how Fenics request sends this information, or if it sends at all?
		    Web order, call center: If road: use the carrier specified on screen. (On screen default: from Dispokarte). If rail: set both carriers to the one specified on 
