Created On    : 09-Dec-2011 / stich
ADN Bugzilla  : ADN77065
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1513 : Implementation of ZCAR-ZNOR logic for vendor interface
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : LOGON needs to distinguish between forwarding agents and subcontractors, based on
                partner functions 'SP' and 'ZC', respectively.
Fix           : interface for vendor master data import completely renewed, see release notes
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : The new logic can be divided into three tasks:
                1. Setting of *flags* on vendor object
				   * If vendor has a PF 'SP' referencing itself, set vn_is_comm_carrier
				   * If vendor has a PF 'ZC' referencing itself, set vn_is_exec_carrier
				   * If vendor has account group 'ZGRP', set vn_is_internal
				2. Creation of *carrier* object
				   * If vn_is_comm_carrier or vn_is_exec_carrier (or both), create carrier
				3. Store vendor *links*
				   * If vendor A has a PF 'ZC' to 'B', store link A->B
				   * If vendor B has a PF 'SP' to 'A', store link A->B
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-persistence/etc/sql/sapimport_vn_pkg.sql

