Symptoms      : -
Description   : Valid supply and delivery plants are not anymore determined by                                                                                                                                                 
               loading the list of plants for the sap material (tlgns_sap_material_plant) and                                                                                                                                   
               the list of plants for the sales area (tlgnc_plant_sarea) and then making its intersection                                                                                                                       
               in Java, but added a new view vlgns_sap_material_plant_sarea which immediately contains the                                                                                                                      
               intersection.                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
               Restrictions are not anymore initialized for all calls where a shipto sales area is involved                                                                                                                     
               and they are not filtered further in Java anymore, but they are immediately loaded according                                                                                                                     
               to the caller, and restrictions are only loaded in case the caller considers it relevant.                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
               This was solved by removing shiptosalesarea.initialze() calls, and therefore needed to take care                                                                                                                 
               of the billto list loading as well which was implicitely called (is present also in .initialize()).                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
               Calls for material.initiaze() has been removed completely, as those were needed to identify the plants                                                                                                           
               for all materials vlgns_sap_material_plant_sarea.                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
               Calls for sarea.initialize() has been removed completely as those were needed to identified the plants
               for the sales area (replaced by vlgns_sap_material_plant_sarea call).
 
               Some places only used the billto list, and restrictions not when they called
               .initialize, others used only the restriction list.
               Change: .initialze() in theory should only be called if the caller needs both 
               the restrictions and the billto list, not just one of them. Loading all the restrictions
               while the caller is not interested in them at all is a waste (see ticket 78431 as well), therefore
               for example in order special removed the .initialize() call as well, and replaced for a simple 
               loading of the billtos.
 
               In the caller context settings tried to name the current constant settings a little more better
               to reflect what they have an effect on. Later on probably some of them could be removed completely.
 
               Affected areas (but all have to work exactly as before this change though, as this is not supposed to change anything):
               1. Dispokarte: still initializes everything, as on Dispokarte user is managing the settings.
               2. Web order: lists are not initialized anymore, will not load all restrictions only web restrictions (or subset of it
                depending on certain circumstances (like contract validity, and if availability of material is still OK, etc.)
               3. Call center: does not initialize the lists anymore, loads all restrictions for the valid contracts basically.
               4. Order special popup: billto list does not load restrictions anymore, only the billtos (it was not using restrictions anyway).
               5. Terminal pickup application: not much change here, as it is not completely using the delivery setting structures
               but still counts on restrictions loaded for the shipto sales area, therefore it loads the shipto sales areas initialized.
               6. Fenics & other weighing systems&all 1-4: not loading all loadingpoint + material restrictions only for the selected material.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
