ADN Change ID : PERSIST1527: Renamed vlgnc_dispo_revenue_planning to vlgnc_dispo_planning
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1st step to replace view vlgnc_dispo_revenue_planning with a view which does not care
		about the carrier's revenue calculation setting.

		Since the prescheduling data is not only stored if the freight revenue is not null
		the view naming 'revenue' is not proper anymore. The new view will also be used if the carrier
		does not necessarily have cost, but uses the prescheduling process. (If an order had been
		dispatched to a planning truck it counts as prescheduled anyway and dispo ui will need to 
		show the plans even though there are no costs involved at all).
		The old view needs to be dropped, but as code is still using it do not do that yet.
		
		Inactive trucks are not displayed anymore on dispo screen. LOGON-4477
