Created On    : 23-Jan-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4541, LOGON-4540, LOGON-4499, LOGON-3897
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1533, COMMON519,BUSINESS2127, ORDER1489, DISPO353 : Linking subcontractor changes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Persist:
		1. Removed completely view vlgnc_dispo_revenue_planning
		It is replaced by vlgnc_dispo_planning, which is not anymore depending on freight cost attribute
		of the carrier. Planning can be made for any order, and the dispo UI has to show facts
		using the planning truck attribute of the order.

		Fenics
		1. LOGON-4541: Fenics: Do not send cancel + transmit to weighing system in case the initiator is Fenics itself 
		2. LOGON-4540: Create assignment if there is no assignment yet in the casae of selectOrderForLoading
		
		Business:
		1. Added parameter to have an effect to send again to weighing system or not in case of transmitToDriver and cancelOnWeighSystem (LOGON-4541, and LOGON-4540)
		
		Scheduling:
		1. Commercial carrier needs to see trucks of executing carrier even if he does not have access to the truck
		according to the authorization rules. Currenly achieving this by adding a widening filter when accessing dispo assignment part list
		and detecting if a part's assignment was not in the original set of assignments defined by the normal truck authorization rules.
		Mark assignments loaded in this second round with 'notAuthorized' flag, and show message for the user if he is deallocating from such a truck.
		(LOGON-4499 / TODO2)

		2. Show the real assignment in grey if it is progressing on a real truck. Do not allow anything on such an assignment though! (LOGON-4541 /6)

		3. Show the planned cost on the planning truck even if there is no assignment at the moment and also if there is an assignment. (LOGON-4541 /5)

		4. LOGON-3897: Do not validate on blur dispo date anymore
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
