Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : the route field can now have four possible values 
                   * Z00001 External Fleet Transport 
                   * Z00002 Own Fleet Transpor 
                   * Z00003 No transport relevant 
                   * Z00004 Correction Flow (Credit Note...) 

Fix           : there is a slight difference between transferdelivery and sales documents 
                   * for transfer delivery documents, credit note is not implemented, only the first three values are possible 
                   * for sales documents, all four values are possible. Z0003 wins over Z0004, which wins over Z0001 and Z0002, 
                   which in turn are mutually exclusive 

