Created On    : 30-Jan-2012 / stich
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4370
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2148, ORDER1496, PERSIST1559: New freight cost calculation algorithm
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : totally revised freight cost algorithm required
Fix           : see release notes
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : 
                   * the freight cost, which was defined per carrier, is now defined per material package type, sales area,
				     shipping point (opt.) and shipto country (opt). the cost is based on a step function, with (normally)
					 decreasing rates for increasing distance
				   * the freight cost is now calculated immediately in order taking and stored (together with the initial currency)
				     in tlgnc_order
				   * when an assignment to a commercial carrier is done, the freight cost is converted to the carrier's currency
				   * as before, the freight cost is stored together with the currency in tlgnc_order_preschedule
				   * since the freight cost can optionally be based on the shipto country, the business partner country is now mandatory
				     and has a foreign key constraint to the new reference table tlgnr_sap_country_bs
				   * the rates are defined in tlgnc_freight_cost. adza_testdata contains very few rates for testing with sales area ADN02-10-10
				     and material package type bulk
				   * there is a new flag on the carrier to indicate that it requires prescheduling. before this change, the flag was implicit
				     in the form of a check whether there is a freight rate defined on the carrier
				   * please check the specification for further details

Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
