Created On    : 07-Feb-2012 / stich
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4319
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1582: Initial data enhancements
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : we got new initial data from HSEE -> needed to be included
Fix           : I have now made the following modifications:
                   * tlgnr_plant_bs contains the complete new list of plants with flags specified. all plants which had
                     been present before but were not present in the new list remain in tlgnr_plant_bs, but with all flags
                     (including the active flag) set to 0. this is done to mitigate the risk of import errors.
                   * tlgnr_sap_shipping_cond_bs now also contains the ship, while all old entries have been kept
                   * person/user/driver/roles has been replaced with the new data
                   * loading point and shipping point has been replaced with the new data

I haven't considered the remaining initial data because for that considerably more effort would be required. Many of the entries we have today are not present in the new excel files anymore, which creates a high risk of SAP import errors when replacing the old initial data with the new one.

If modifications of that initial data is required, we need a complete list of the actual initial data with clear indications on what can replace existing initial data without any risk. 

Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-persistence/etc/csv/fbnl_initialdata/loadingpoint.csv
M logon-persistence/etc/csv/fbnl_initialdata/shippingpoint.csv
