Description   : Order's distribution destination code is set according to the shipto sales area's distribution destination from:
		  1. fenics
		  2. wewas
		  3. order taking overall
		  4. pickup order
		  5. web order
		  
		 No change in case (as in 1.6.0):
		  1. Rail repair order: always with REP
		  2. Return order: 
		      2.a. if preceding INB -> INBR
		      2.b. if preceding OUT -> OUTR
		      2.c. if preceding IUDB -> IUDR
		      2.d. if preceding IUP -> IUPR
		      2.e. if preceding REP -> IUDR
		  3. Order special popup (to be specified on screen)

		  Frozen table: We_Distribution_Dest_Cd will from now on be set to the value of the 
		  shipto sarea's distribution_dest_cd. OPEN ITEM: Is this change OK? The table naming should be for that
		  We_ST_Distribution_Dest_Cd (note: ST in the middle).
