Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : Fixes some minor bugs and missing additional validations.
				* 1) Active flag (truck/trailer) -> The status checkbox is now disabled in case of non-planning trucks and trailers.
				* 2) SAP Number at Sap Generic truck/trailer -> If the truck/trailer is disabled from SAP, then the status checkbox's label additionally contains (Disabled from SAP).
				* 3) Prevention of wrong composition switch -> The trailer selection dropdown now only shows the trailers with same characteristic.
				* 5) Internal flag value at UI processing -> Newly created planning trucks/trailers get the internalFlag value from the vendor from now on. Generic truks were fine.
