Description   : In OrderService moved truck composition check right at the entry point of startload function, as cancel was already sent when 
		the composition was detected to be invalid. The cancel should also happen only after all entry checkes had been
		passed successfully.
		
		Part 1: Added a new check: if the truck specified is a planning truck then also refuse startload. 
		No new execption introduced as this is not a real life case normally, and on shipping screen it is also prevented from now on
		(see below).

		Thrown exception: the same as is for invalid composition:
		RES_ERROR_INVALID_TRUCK_COMPOSITION (res.error.invalid.truck.composition) Truck composition is invalid.

		Part 2: On the shipping screen it is prevented by not showing input fields and checkmark if the order is only on a planning truck.
