Created On    : 30-Mar-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4596
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2200, ORDER1543: Cleanup related to EJB injections
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The method loading the db order needs to be in a separate transaction, but REQUIRES_NEW only
		works if it is intercepted, in normal cases it would not.
		
		Previously tried to guarantee it by making sure that the caller service calls the method 
		through a private Service reference injected with @EJB annotation. 

		This solution is not often in Logon, only used in case of cron jobs, never from 
		actions. Rather making sure that the only call which needs to be a separate transaction
		is using jndi remote interface lookup, therefore making sure that the transaction is separated.

		Fix for failing NB.
