Created On    : 06-Apr-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4596
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2210: Reallocate counts also an event which needs to be saved per order
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : After weighing system or manual reallocation on truck scheduling screen bizevent
		transmitted to truck and arrived at loadingpoint still disappears from order log.
		(Disappears means that events of the previous assignment are not considered for the order
		 therefore are not visible).
Description   : Events for an assignment before a cancel assignment event with order and assignment attribute
		makes possible to be able to know that events before the cancel belonging only to the assignment
		belong also to the order.
		As reallocate also detaches the order from an assignment and inactivates the assignment, reallocation event
		should behave similarly and should be saved for all orders which are reallocated from the assignment.

		Tested from Fenics selectOrderForLoading request: transmitted to truck event was visible.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
