Created On    : 16-Apr-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4776
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1656: When creating tlgnc_mat_plant in the import, create also in all existing languages the tlgnc_mat_plant_tx entries
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Created load_tlgnc_mat_plant_tx prodecure which will create in all languages present in tlgnr_lang_bs the language dependent
		entry for the passed in (new) mat_plant_id.

		Will run only when a create of tlgnc_mat_plant is triggered in the import (only once - if the mat_plant entry (sap_material_id + plant_cd) 
		does not exist yet - and never again).

		This also means that if a material + plant combination already exists when a material request comes (update) nothing will
		happen with the language dependent table.
  
		Field CHROMAT_REDUCTION_TXT is initialized to NULL.

		The point is only to guarantee that the mat_plant_tx entry exists, nothing more.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
