ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4836
ADN Change ID : ORDER1579: Adding 'release for real trucks' possibility for simple schedulers - even if prescheduling process had been skipped
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Before:
		If for an order no prescheduling had been done, and prescheduling was required, releasing was only possible for users having authorization for
		function 'Dispatching: write access for pool management (3002)'. Users who have only authorization for function 'Dispatching: write access (3001)'
		were not able to release or deallocate.

		After:
		If for an order no prescheduling had been done, and prescheduling was required releasing and cancelling is possible for
		  for users having authorization for function 'Dispatching: write access for pool management (3002)'
		  for users who have authorization for function 'Dispatching: write access (3001)' but only if the truck is a real truck
