Created On    : 11-May-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4846
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2240, ORDER1583: Schedule on partner executing carriers and refactoring
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Technical change on the scheduling screen: before the commit there were two objects related to carriers. One was 
		the carrier list untouched since version 1.6 (name list1) which contains all the carriers which are authorized for the user
		regardless of being commercial or executing carrier. Another object also a list(name list2) was storing the partner functions
		of these carriers, and this list was only used to built up per order the carrier dropdown, and avoided authorization in
		order to let the orders forward also to not authorized carriers (executing carriers who have a scheduler).
		
		As the partner functions are from now on needed also when dragging and dropping rather merged these two lists into one
		wrapper object (DispoCarrierWrapper), which holds a reference to the PoolCarrierCarrier entity (basically the carrier entity for which the user
		is authorized and belongs to the selected pool - content of list 1 from the 1.6 version), and which contains a list of the 
		partner functions and through that the name and id of the executing carriers held before separately on the form in list 2.

		Thus it's easier to get the partners for the selected commercial carrier, and javascript code can be a little less complicated.
		
		Dragging and dropping on certain trucks is from now on depending also on the partner function: the truck's carrier must be amongst
		the partners of the commercial carrier.
		
		The rule how one can drop orders depends now rather on the attributes commercial and executing carrier setting than on the order status.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/DispoServiceBean.java
A logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/utils/DispoCarrierWrapper.java
