ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4820, LOGON-4823, LOGON-4574
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2248, COMMON609, CUST172, ORDER1597: Alternative UOM changes on call center, web order, overall order taking sources
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Delivery setting subject GUI related: Added resolution of uomCds to uom txt in the delivery settings. Needed for being able to show the 
		uom name on web order uom dropdown.

		Delivery setting background data related: As uoms from now are material selection dependent they are not anymore 
		  global. Renamed MaterialLoadingAtShiptoBackgroundData  MaterialAvailabilityBackgroundData as it is rather related to
		  the material availability overall, not specifically only related to the shipto.

		GUIs using advanced material combo (Dispokarte sales area tab, web order tab - 1st and nth dropdowns, call center - 1st and nth 
		material dropdowns: Created separate custom ext combo as it was highly redundant everywhere and is supposed to be shown also on order
		detail services tab in the future as well.

		Web order: no uom list is necessary in web order anymore, therefore removed it from the form, also from the GUI.

		Call center: no global uom list is necessary anymore, as it is as all the other dropowns from now: dependent on the material
			selected. Removed uom map and list from the call center form, and also removed its usage from the customer order popup.

		Also affects order create handlers (validation) order save validation, pickup order validation.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
