ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4621
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1716: Initial data for cluster 1 (CHE/NGE), First round.
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Holcim provided a first set of initial data / masterdata.
		/share/doc/holcim/logon_2_1/input/Cluster1_refdata_initialdata/
		20120528_Customizing_master_data_for_ITC1_-_Cluster_1_-_v1.1.xlsx and
		initial_data_shippingpoint_loadingpoint_ITC1__cluster1_v1.1_20120528.xlsx
Fix           : Although it is for CHE, NGE, SGE (i.e., all known since LOGON 1.0-1.6)
		it must be considered a completely new set of initialdata/sap reference data.
		Reason: All codes in SAP for plant, shippingpoint, sales orgs, sales offices,
		etc have changed.
		Therefore, I have started a new directory, cl_initialdata. The original
		CHE/NGE initialdata (etc/sql/initialdata and etc/sql/nge_initialdata
		are considered "obsolete", but helpful to gradually transform and update
		for EBM/Cluster 1. Some of the files (plant_track, transportation zones)
		have also been reused already. Others (wagons?? PDA devices?) will have
		to be analysed together with "data migration" or bigger topics, together
		with Holcim.
Workaround    : -
