ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : TEST432: small improvements
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : 1) irrelevant (0-test) *Test* named classes are removed from the int.test report:

		LogonSeleniumTestCase
		TableBrowserTestDataSupport
		PropertyTransferTest
		CallCenterTestProperties
		CallCenterTestCase
		RoadWorkflowTestProperties
		ExternalTestProperties

		2) int.test report re-labeled, now it's "Integration Test Results" not "Unit Test Results"

		3) PNG screenshots are bigger now

		According to Sabine, it is currently not possible to save the full page into PNG.
		The jcan-test version Logon uses (0.10.0.0) does not support selenium.logging.fullscreen property, and even with an upgrade to a newer version which would,
		we could only save the viewport content and not the full page.
		I added a selenium.windowMaximize() call to enlarge the browser window but it's still less than the full page.

