Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : A) Please add following columns to tlgnr_truck_type_bs:
                The following columns were added to the tlgnr_truck_type_bs table:
                * truck_type_is_agg, Number(1,0), non nullable,
                * truck_type_is_cem, Number(1,0), non nullable,
                * volume_m3, Number(12,4), nullable,
                * max_gross_weight_t, Number(12,4), non nullable.
				Created updates for the non-empty tlgnr_truck_type_bs tables with default values.
				
				Updated on all four databases.
				
				B) Update volume_m3 data type:
				Updated the tlgnc_wagon.volume_m3 and tlgnc_truck.volume_m3 (from number(6,0) to number(12,4)):
				* tlgnc_wagon.volume_m3,
				* tlgnc_truck.volume_m3.
				Updated all the referenced m3 fields because of dependecies (All changed from number(6,0) to number(12,4)):
				* tlgnc_shipto_silo.max_volume_m3,
				* tlgnf_order_final.wagon_volume_m3,
				* tlgnf_order_item_final.silo_max_volume_m3,
				* tlgnf_order_item_final.wagon_volume_m3,
				* tlgnr_truck_type_bs.volume_m3,
				* tlgnr_wagon_type_bs.volume_m3,
				* tlgns_sap_vehicle.sap_vehicle_volume_m3.

				Updated on all four databases.

				Updated Java source files to match the new data type (from Long to java.math.BigDecimal)
				* New method in StringUtils class to convert String value to java.math.BigDecimal
				* Updated usages on all m3 variable references in varius Action classes (see Affected Files section)
