Created On    : 05-Jul-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5006
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2292, ORDER1623, TERMINAL073: Moving filter functions to a separate file, filtering delivery types by selected uom
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : For combination the 'bag material (logon package type = bag)' + 'fuzzy unit of measure' the  delivery type 'pickup' is 
		not anymore available for selection, and does not count as a valid setting -> order taking will not be possible for
		this triple.

		Dispokarte: after selecting uom LKW the delivery type pickup is not available anymore
		Call center: if LKW is selected - delivery type pickup is selectable, but will not be possible to save (cause: there is no re-rendering
			    of the delivery type dropdown.
		Web order: as on dispokarte not possible to specify this combination, this combination is not available. If SAP updates the package type
			   of the sap material, which - suppose - never happens even if the combination is defined on dispokarte, saving will not be possible.
		Pickup order: same rules as for web order
		Weighing systems, other order taking sources: same as for web order
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
