Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Class loader issue - logon-security subproject: Added new table for login configurations
Fix           : 1.) Table definition can be found in tlgnc_config_login_module.xml. The table did not inherit the min, max description columns. This is because it this way we were able to solve the problem elagantly (please consult ConfigServiceBean:initializeLoginModuleConfiguration()); 2.) Login module (logon-security) is now retrieving it's values from  tlgnc_config_login_module (previously: tlgnr_config); 3.) On startup the login related config values should be transferred to the new table
