Created On    : 12-Jul-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4964, LOGON-4971, LOGON-4740
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1780, BUSINESS2303, ORDER1630, COMMON632: Truck type tables for various business objects
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Persist:
		Added table for shiptos for storing cement truck type priorities and restrictions, and for storing
		 aggregate truck type priorities and restrictions. As certain truck types are marked available for both
		aggregate and cement separate table is needed for them.

		Added table for storing order level truck type restrictions. This table is currently empty, and not used,
		it is supposed to be initialized from each order taking source considering the above mentioned shipto
		preferences.

		Added table for storing default truck type restriction. As for normal defaults truck type restrictions will
		be possible to be defined per material + sales area.

		Moved Truck type wrappers to business because they will be needed from all order taking sources.

		Frozen table stores only the identified optimal truck type per shipto, and currently does NOT store the same for
		aggregate. Comment is also not updated accordingly.

		UI:
		Dispokarte got the two now road tabs: CEM+AGG to be able to manage the truck type preferences.
		Dispokarte is able to use the tables, but probably refactoring will later on be needed when the defaults have to use
		the bakcing lists as a basic selection available.

		Overall:
		This first version is ment to work, and to be able to experiment first and check how code needs to be changed later on.
		
		Other things to consider: managing deleted/merged/updated lists seems to be overcomplicated, it would be necessary to
		find out why it was not ment to be handled by onetomany entity relation, but loaded 'manually' and merged manually back.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
