Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Added new input field for unloading time below the truck chart on Call Center Heading.
				The field filled automatically with the default value (calculated with fallback logic) based on selections at the "New Order" section.
				The default value can be overridden by entering the unloading time value to the field.
				Selecting the following fields reloades the truck chart section with the unloading time input field in it:
				* SapMaterial,
				* ShipToSilo.
				Known issue: 
				* Selecting a ShipToSilo will cause all fields to reset except for the SapMaterial field.
