Created On    : 03-Aug-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4751, LOGON-5123
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1818, BUSINESS2346,COMMON650,  CUST181, TERMINAL076: Dispokarte switched to editor like ext js controls, 
			      fixed broken functionality regarding changing anything
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Dispokarte Save related changes:

		Broken since BUSINESS2329: dispokarte still uses a lot more structures 
		than it would need to use. The one, which is commonly used
		and loaded in delvierysettingservice: DeliverySettingShiptoMap 
		was called with the parameter shiptosalesareas. See problem description 
		in the ticket LOGON-5123. Fix: initialization of web beans 
		should happen at the same time when the business structure is loaded, and
		the ui initialization has to use the business structure's 
		shiptosalesarea entities not the ones which were passed in as value.
		Questionable also that updateSalesareas is separate still. Probably that
		should also be in the very same business transaction.
		DispokarteAction, DispokarteEntryAction, DispokarteShipToAction are rather involved in this, 
		and from DispokarteForm removed the own property
		shipto ans shiptosalesareas, those should from now only be accessed
		through the business structure DeliuverySettingShiptoMap



		Overall Cleanup: 
		
		removed ShiptoSalesAraUtil class, it was not useful
		anymore, it was just complicating function calls to the loading of
		sales area related business structure. These files only changed 
		because of getting rid of it: WebBestellungAction, WebBestellungEntryAction,
		PickupOrderBean



		Dispokarte sales area tab reimplementation of the whole screen + handling of new fields: 

		Dispokarte had hundreds of code lines just to retrieve the lists 
		coming from the business object
		DeliverySettingSalesAreaMap and it's product list. This made code
		hard to read. On behalf of LOGON-4751 about 10 new fields needed to be added
		to the screen, which would make it also necessary to implement it
		similarly with more and more code which is not even similar to the
		call center ext js solution, but basically does the same using the
		same business structures, but accessing it through plenty of setters in the 
		form. 
		The current idea is: one parameter dto is what is constructed from the extjs 
		comboboxes, flags, and input fields. The shipto default first checks
		if the whole selection is valid, and nulls immediately those attributes which became invalid:
		      example: shippingpoint is selected, but user changes supply plant -> 
		      shippingpoint needs to be reset
		
		 Added litdict entries needs to be recheked they are not used yet.



		Changes in PERSISTENCE: 

		all flags on tlgnc_shipto_sarea_restr are not nullable
		from now on, on adding new restriction already made
		it sure that those are initialized as false. In the patch added changing them 
		to 0 if they were null and also making them to
		not nullable.

		Added onHoldOrderAndLockedFlag on the default as spec required it.



		REMINDER TO CLEANUP:
		Further cleanup needed: javascript functions throughout dispokarte, marked several of them with a comment. 
		      Also uncommented methods in DispokarteForm
		      and OrderAjaxService needs to be removed soon. For now leaving to be able to check later on how it looked like if something does not work.
		
		Concept needs to be rethought around DeliverySettingBasicDTO, DeliverySettingDTO, AbstractDeliverySetting, 
		      they are now messy as constructors were used
		      until now to populate the dtos, and now DeliverySettingBasicDTO comes from the UI using 
		      the setters.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : See testing concerns in ticket what's tested and working and what's broken.
