Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : GetMaterialsForShiptoRequestHandler was looking up shipto and soldto by sap bp id, which is not the one
		the LDS sends. LDS knows nothing about the tlgns_ table primary keys, therefore no handler should use those
		ids to look up the entity.

		Missing production plant would cause nullpointer. As it is a mandatory field it's absence will not be 
		allowed and response will be failure anyway. In the meantime it's more descriptive than the nullpointer.
