Created On    : 08-Aug-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5058
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2366: AddServiceMaterialsToOrder handler update
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Production plant is coming from the request setting it into the service item. On the long run it will not be received at all,
		but in the current release the production plant attribute of an order item is mandatory, therefore
		at least we need to give chance to be able to specify that mandatory attribute. 
	      
		Assumption: making production plant attribute optional is another lrq. When implementing that change this lookup 
		might be removed, but probably makes no difference, it's not a problem if Logon receives a production plant
		it sets into the service item.

		itemData element content: Changes in LDSServiceBean createOrderItemData: only add loadId attribute if the loadId is set. This makes it possible 

		that we can call this createOrderItemData function even when there is no load yet for the order item, but use a common function to fill out the
		fields to be sent. (note: did NOT add because of the service item added by the LDS, but because of the order item which 
		can miss the load reference yet when the new service item is added (as the result of an AddServiceMaterialsToOrder request) .).


		ServiceMaterialItem element content: if production plant is not specified, leave productionPlant attribute and all dependent fields empty

		ServiceMaterialItem structure also has materialData structure inside, and construction of this material data is common for all order items:
		it is the same for service material and normal material. Plant attribute will not be mandatory on the long run for service items, thus the
		production plant, and the mat plant attributes will only be filled in in case there is a production plant for the order item. 
		Necessary because otherwise it would fail for service order item materialData. Another option: construct materialData for service items 
		differently.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/in/logon_lds_interface/AddServiceMaterialsToOrderRequestHandler.java
M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/LDSServiceBean.java

