				1.) "Order Entry" 
				Update chart filters and generate new chart, when the following filters change:
				- "Deliver From time"
				- "Delivery type"
				- "Pool"
				
				2.) Add a new filter "Company code":
				The "Plant" filter is based on the company code.
				To map the plant to company code, a new DB view is introduced: "vlgnc_plant_sarea_compcode".
				The built in authorization:
				- TLGNU_USER_COMPANYCODE_ACC
				- TLGNU_USER_SAREA_ACC
				- TLGNU_USER_PLANT_ACC 
