Created On    : 28-Aug-2012 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1860: tlgns_sap_mat_plant_norm no read/write daoprovider due to refdata=true.
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Startup error when authorization check is on:
		description: java.lang.NoSuchMethodException: com.holcim.logon.persistence.utils.DaoProvider.getSapMatPlantNormEntityDao()
Description   : -
Fix           : table name="TLGNS_SAP_MAT_PLANT_NORM" was declared with refData="true" by mistake.
		(Could be seen also by the missing ctl_tcn field).
		Generated DaoProvider now contains:
    public ReadWriteDao<SapMatPlantNormEntity> getSapMatPlantNormEntityDao() {
        if (sapMatPlantNormEntityDao == null) {
            sapMatPlantNormEntityDao = new ReadWriteDaoImpl<SapMatPlantNormEntity>(em, authorizer, SapMatPlantNormEntity.class);
        }
        return sapMatPlantNormEntityDao;
    }
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
