Created On    : 30-Aug-2012 / paksyd
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5262
ADN Change ID : PKG136: SAP material import: material imported even though is_cem=0, is_agg=0, is_lf=0
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : Several import requests which belongs to the same material could update the same material record.
                If in one request the import cannot examine the salesarea, all of the material type flags were remain 0 and the material record was updated with these values.
				From now on when no salesare available to examine for the material type, the import loads the flags from the previously saved record in tlgns_sap_material before updating it.
				This solution came from the already implemented treatment, that handles material_package_cd null value.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
