Created On    : 04-Sep-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5242
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2442, CUST185, ORDER1730, COMMON671, PERSIST1865: Renaming field hold_back_sap_flag to release_sap_flag
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Until now on order taking sources the flag hold back SAP flag was using an inverse logic, and always saved the inverse
		what was specified by the user. The cause is that on the screen it was named Release SAP but in the meantime in the code it was 
		used to check if sending to SAP must be prevented or not.
		Due to the inverse logic code was overcomplicated.
	      
		Until now: holb_back_sap_flag = 0 this is equivalent from now with release_sap_flag = 1
		Until now: holb_back_sap_flag = 1 this is equivalent from now with release_sap_flag = 0

		Sending to SAP is ment to be using from this point on the new value, and all initialization is ment as-was.
		
	        Changing the field's name required also litdict change and also the audit description update of this field.
		Order final table had also been updated to reflect this new name, the values are updated in the patch accordingly.

		Views had been updated accordingly, but there will be a next update because of required = true.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
