ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5302, LOGON-4746
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1869: Adding casts to first_value usages
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Using first_value was necessary for the chart views, but the problem is that 
		a view attribute which is from a first_value is resolved to a double at the end
		by adnant oraviews. The xml file in cvshead contained the proper types already, the only change there
		is a whitespace which is added by adnant oraviews.

		As a summary it can be declared that the following view xml files already present in 2.1.0 are in sync with the custom_views.sql
		after this commit.

		VLGNC_ORD_CHART_NOT_ASSIGNED
		VLGNC_CHART_LOAD_UNSCHEDULED
		VLGNC_CHART_LOAD_SCHEDULED
		VLGNC_TRUCK_CHART_ASSIGNED
