Created On    : 10-Sep-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5242
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2450, COMMON676, CUST186, ORDER1739: Reimplement Logon 1.6 and 2.0 features and DeliverySettingDTO related changes
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Structural change: removing DeliverySettingWrapper class. This class was a little bit confusing,
		  it was basically a DeliverySettingDTO, only held language dependent data, it had no other functionality.
		  Rather moved its content to the DeliverySettingDTO to an inner class structure, which is either initialized or
		  not depending on the fact if the caller wants it initialized or not.
	      
		  On Dispokarte ListLose.jsp changed the way how the page is loaded. Until now for each row there was an ajax
		  call which retrieved the deliverysetting one by one. This was rather slow, now trying to change it
		  to load the restrcitionDeliverySettings from the JSON list stored in the sales area.

		  For reimplementing 1.6 features removed not anymore working javascript code which was manipulating 
		  at the end of the page load sap flags and free of charge flags. The cause why this is changed is that 
		  both on call center and also on dispokarte the same thing happened, and the logic was implemented
		  in javascript on both screens differently. Now the DeliverySettingDTO is able to declare if free of charge
		  or release SAP or other fields are editable with the same logic what was in javascript in Logon 1.6.
		  From now it would be good to have all similar functionality in the DeliverySettingDTO itself in order
		  that we can keep the javascript codes similar on call center and dispokarte too. 

		  In order to be able to determine if the free of charge flag is editable or not needed shiptoSarea attribute
		  release_sap_flag_optional. In the meantime until now the DeliverySettingDTO did not have such attribute,
		  therefore did not have enough information to be able to determine this. Added as a constructor parameter,
		  because in the future there might be other attributes which are available on the shiptoSarea and actually
		  it is available.

		  From Dispokarte removed the usage of cash sales flag. It is from now built in the logic to determine if
		  free of charge flag is editable in DeliverySettingDTO.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

