Created On    : 11-Sep-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5299, LOGON-5242
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2456, ORDER1741: DeliverySettingDTO new constructor from parameters
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : There was a need for this new constructor, as setters are ment to be missing from the
		DTO. Until now the parameters should have come from the restriction, contract/restriction, 
		contract only, material only. Other case was not possible.

		In the meantime this is the first step to have an object containing all the data with 
		entity references which can be used trustworthy in OrderAjaxservice getCollectedEditorData further on.

		Purpose: the DeliverySettingDTO containing all the new refereces can be used to set up later
		on the customer order and customer order item parameters, and thus we will be able to get rid of
		the bad direction: setting to Order/OrderItem -> beanutils copy to customer order, and then
		setup the OrderEntity from the customerorder. One step can be left out: constructing the Order/OrderItem
		and the parameters can directly go to the CustomerOrder.

		From DeliverySettingDTO removed attributes available in customer web, the notes, and all those fields
		which are completely ShiptoSareaRestEntity dependent and are currently not even applicable for
		delivery settings set up on the call center. Purpose: the DeliverySetting and DeliverySettingBasicDTO
		is supposed to contain ALL those fields which are BOTH on dispokarte and call center, but NONE of those
		which are only on dispokarte.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
