ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2479, COMMON687, PERSIST1900: LRQ 279.2 Export Invoice (Block 3)
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : 
				1.) Create a new usage type (TLGNR_CONF_SEQ_COUNT_USAGE) for the export invoice number fetching at endload and add to initial data sql scripts. Implement the fetching of the new number when the endload succeeds. Keep in mind that if a number already exists in tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER_USAGE_DEP no new number needs to be fetched and stored. 
				
				2.) Adapt delivery note generation
				Change delivery note header title:
				if tlgnc_order.SEQ_USAGE_CD==2 then print
				(EN) "Export Invoice"
				
				3.) Adapt Outgoing (LOGON->SAP) request for Sales Document
				If tlgnc_order.SEQ_USAGE_CD==2 then send
				tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER_USAGE_DEP in /sales_document_creation/document_header_reference_data/ZINVOICE
				(Logistic External invoice number)
