Created On    : 19-Sep-2012 / bartha
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/jira/browse/LOGON-4812
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2486: LRQ 279.4 Sequential Numbering for Delivery Notes & Export Invoices (Block 3): Mapping Specification SalesDocument, TransferDocument 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : 
				1.) Outbound Delivery interface:
	        	LIFEX: LOGON will send the "printed" BIG delivery number.
			        Case Sales Area Configuration:
					"Print order number from dispatch system instead of LOGON order number" = YES
					THEN: send weighing system order number (TLGNC_LOAD.WS_DELIVERY_NOTE_NO)
					ELSE: send tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER_USAGE_DEP if empty/null send tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER
				ZDELI: LOGON will always send here the LOGON delivery number.
					Send tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER
				If Export Invoice (Contract Type = ZCEX)
					ZINVOICE: send tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER_USAGE_DEP or if empty tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER
				
				2.)Transfer Deliveries interface:
				LOGON will send the "printed" BIG delivery number.
				LIFEX: Same as in Sales Doc
				IHREZ: LOGON will always send here the LOGON delivery number.
					Send tlgnc_order.ORDER_NUMBER
				
				3.) Shipment interface:
				LIFEX: LOGON will send the "printed" BIG delivery number.
					Same as in Sales Doc
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/SapOutgoingDataServiceBean.java

