ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2509, PERSIST1908, SIMUL093, WSCLIENT161: fixes for LDS interface
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 
                   * no loadOrderNotifications were sent if no loadingpoint was set on any order item
				   * loadID/loadOrderItemId changed in case of reallocation from planning truck to real truck

Description   : -
Fix           : 
                   * loadOrderNotifications are now sent if at least one LP of the SP uses the weighing system of the SP
				   * instead of TLGNC_LOAD.LOAD_ID, a new id, TLGNC_LOAD.LOAD_ORDER_ITEM_ID is used. it is based on the sequence
				     SLGNC_LOAD_ORDER_ITEM. in case of reallocation, it is copied over to the new load

