ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5231
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2540, ORDER1796, PERSIST1915: Wagon idle time and dedicated shiptos for Bimodal railcare monitoring
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Assumption in the previous version of bimodal monitoring was that the idle time value has to show
		the same what's shown on wagon search - idle time on the current railway station. As it seems for this screen
		the intention is to show only the spent time at the shipto station, therefore switching the calculation from
		last_known_railway_station_dat to actual_delivery_dat, and only calculate in case the bimodal rail order
		is in status arrived at unloading point, unloading or delivered.

		Dedicated shiptos are now rendered on bimodal monitoring screen.

		Fix for the problems: 6&7&8&10
