ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2541, PERSIST1917: Vehicle type dropdown returns empty list for all materials which are not marked cem/landfill/agg
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The vehicle type dropdowns will be empty in this case because it is not agg/lf/cem material -> either of cem/agg truck list
		would be just bad. Other option would be to return all of them. Probably at some point this will happen, 
		but at the moment the only goal is to prevent nullpointer in determining the lists.

		Vehicle type list is on purpose not used for validation: the dispokarte defaults are for the truck types RESTRICTIONS and not 
		DEFAULTS. Currently it would be too difficult to validate the truck types against the Dispokarte setting.

		Problems regarding that: 
		    1. Technical problem: Dispokarte is always used as defaults for other attributes -> where validation takes place the 
		    shipto_sarea_restr restrictions are not really present.

		    2. Theoretical problem: On Dispokarte a material can be defined multiple times with different restrictions -> which
		    one to take into consideration when validating the order?

		Removed is_cem, is_lf, is_agg flags from all services/pallets.
