ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2543: Multidrop shipment delivered on a truck without PDA sets loaded/delivered qty incorrect - fixed
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Loaded quantity is overwritten at endload with the merged net quantity of the load. 
		The case when this was bad: multidrop shipment (other name: bag tour) but only in case the truck on what the 
		order was dispatched is a truck without pda. See also ticket description.
Description   : In bag case updating the loaded quantity should never happen, as it is made sure from all sources, that the
		loaded quantity is first set, and the load net quantity gets the merged value. Copying back the net quantity
		from the load messes up the loaded quantity.
