Created On    : 02-Oct-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5353
ADN Change ID : ORDER1798, BUSINESS2544: Ordering of bizevents by default should be by bizevent_id
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Order status entries are in listed in a wrong sequence order detail/order log frame.
Description   : Ordering by the composite id is not good anymore (composite_id= bizevent_id || lang_cd). 
		Until the are in the same range (0-1000) -> no problem. But from the point the last bizevents 
		are in separate range which happens often as it seems with the sending to SAP bizevents 
		(most of the bizevents 0-1000) then send to SAP ts (1000-10000) the ordering is messed up.
Fix           : Do NOT order by the composite_id, order by the bizevent_id, as that will be just fine also
		if there is a huge range difference between the first and last bizevent.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
