Description   : Fixes the following issues:
				* LOGON-5104 / issue 15: All the rows, which belong together, will have the same color. Like this we have again a visual grouping of the screen. If there is an assignment, and it has multiple loads, even if the handler specifies the load for one of the loads of the assignment, that row will not disappear after the save, because the truck still has open load(s). All the rows should only disappear if all the materials are loaded which belong to that assignment. Also pay attention that when sorting the list, these assignments stay together.
