Created On    : 09-Oct-2012 / emoke
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5540, LOGON-5541, LOGON-5390
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2600, COMMON725, ORDER1809, TERMINAL087: Moving initialization by contract at the end of order creation -> solving several bugs by that see description
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : LOGON-5540: Autoadd material does not set properly the cash sales fields. Cause:
		    Problem 1: service which was supposed to load the alternative uoms was passed as null (suppose because actually there was even no way to pass
				a service reference from AutoaddMaterialHelper) -> no chance to initialize -> uom fields are left empty
		    Problem 2: iteration over alternative uoms, but not only considering the first one, simply a bug.
	      
		     Changes in: AutoaddMaterialHelper.java, OrderUtils.java
		    
		LOGON-5541: Leave rate and currency empty, before persisting it will be filled out according to the contract setting from postProcessOrder. Do the same on custorder
			    level (CustorderServiceBean.postprocesscustorder), these fields do not depend directly on user/LDS input, but are redundant from the contract/contract item.

		      Changes in: AbstractOrderDataToCustorderRequestHandler.java
		
		LOGON-5390: Because of rate problems service material adding causes save failure. 
		      Cause: setContractDependentAttributes cannot handle order item without a contract -> nullpointer. Adapted LogonUtil to be able to handle this situation.
			     Merged three functions:
				1. findAndSetCurrencyforServiceItems (this is the behaviour what needs to be done for entries where the currency cannot come from the contract).Set 
				  rate to NULL and set the currency according to the common currency of the order. -> Fucntion is deprecated and will be removed
				2. setDeliverySettingAttributes this one could handle the setting without contract, but in the postprocess rather don't use deliverysetting, but pure
				    entities -> Fucntion is deprecated and will be removed, calls using this now will use setContractDependentAttributes
				3. setContractDependentAttributes: added NULL check for contract and init rate and currency if that is missing how setDeliverySettingAttributes did.

		      Changes in: OrderUtils.java, OrderActionSupport.java
				
		Other files are cleaned up: removed setContractDependentAttributes call as that step is now explicitely done before persisting, no need to call it from
		      BestellungAction.java, PickupOrderItemBean.java.
		      
		Moved validation of pickup order to orderservice, hopefully it will turn out that the same checks are done in the other order taking sources -> code can be removed
		    from there.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/ordercreation/AutoaddMaterialHelper.java
