Created On    : 10-Oct-2012 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5184, LOGON-5553
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1932: Testdata Rail vendors, Testdata billto-rhythm, vendor:carrier 1:0/1
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 1) Billto rhythm: No suitable initial testdata existed (only 1 billto per shipto)
		2) vendor:carrier testdata issue with adza rail vendor, breaks user-admin
		3) legacy vendor:carrier 1:N without any value/significance, but causes bugs again and again
		4) testusers: some did not have all current roles.
Description   : -
Fix           : 1) Added a new BP as billto for Zumdorf + Albula, taken from Swiss production: HG COMMERCIALE, Luzern.
		Also added purchase org + partnerfunctions, so, should be useable also in upcoming user-authorization extensions.
		2) Added a new SBB-vendor, instead of only having 2 _active_ carriers pointing to 1 vendor (which is wrong)
		3) Got rid of that 1:N possiblity in vendor:carrier, and enforce 1:0/1 by adding a UQ constraint, and updated DB comments. Also updated our testdata (get rid of carrier -14).
		4) added missing roles (so that they are equivalent to logonadmin)
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
