ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5624
ADN Change ID : DISPO469: Scheduling: Dragged order disappears when real trucks are hidden
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : * Fixed the bogus calculation when the real trucks section is hidden.
				  Background: roundXTicks() function used the dispoDiv from the real trucks section, 
				  but if it was hidden, the calculation ended up with negative number.
				  Therefore when the the real trucks is hidden, the function uses the planning div instead.
				  If both the planning and real trucks section are hidden, then do not calculate.
				* Fixed the "this.dom.parentNode" JavaScript error.
