---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Created On    : 18-Oct-2012 / bartha
ADN Bugzilla  : https://aww.adnovum.ch/jira/browse/LOGON-5083
ADN Change ID : ADMIN1029, BUSINESS2695, ORDER1832: ProxyGenerator.generateStaticInitializer fails for RefDataServiceBean 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : With more refdata tables the ProxyGenerator.generateStaticInitializer fails for RefDataServiceBean (again the code size limit exceeded)
Fix           : 
The RefDataServiceBean_4all.java.vm template generates overlaoded functions. 
i.e: public List<[XYZEntityClass]> find[XYZEntityClass]List()

java code:
"
    public List<WeighSystemLpTxEntity> findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(Locale locale) {
	        return findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(false, locale, null, true);
	}

	public List<WeighSystemLpTxEntity> findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(Locale locale, String orderByField, boolean isAscending) {
	       return findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(false, locale, orderByField, isAscending);
	}

	public List<WeighSystemLpTxEntity> findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(boolean isActive, Locale locale, String orderByField, boolean isAscending) {
	      final Filter<WeighSystemLpTxEntity> filter = createFilter(WeighSystemLpTxEntity.class, "weighSystemLpTxPK.weighSystemLpBs.ctlActCd", isActive, "weighSystemLpTxPK.langCd", locale, StringUtils.defaultString(orderByField, WeighSystemLpTxEntity.ATTR_TXT), isAscending);
	      return RefDataUtil.findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(em, filter);
	}
" 

Here the master function (containing the implementation) is the third service  (public List<WeighSystemLpTxEntity> findWeighSystemLpTxEntityList(boolean isActive, Locale locale, String orderByField, boolean isAscending)).
The other two are potential volunteers, to be removed.

As a quick fix the second service is commented out. The references to that service are updated
to use the master (third) service. 

TEST: 
1.) adnant clean dist     --> will compile all java classes with the fresh generated objects (java object reference check)
2.) logon/container  -> adnant app-precompile     --> will precompile the jsp (jsp reference check)
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

