Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : initSingleDeliveryOrdersStatus should ignore the boolan flags received 
		which define the status. 

		Cleanup - context is not anymore there in the persist customer order.

		Processcustomerorder has to validate orders because it is used by the lds validate handler
		for which the point is exactly that to have validation.

		As far the invalid map of the sales area is not considered sales area level problems are not
		reported.

		Commit  is not supposed to change anything except that guarantees that pickups are immediately transmitted to carrier,
		and processCustomerOrder will validate the order.
