Created On    : 21-Oct-2012 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5638, LOGON-4620, LOGON-4621
ADN Change ID : PERSIST1965: Update C0/C1 initialdata, adapt testdata, fix vehicle initialdata
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : 1) Holcim decided to load C0+C1 cluster in each of the DBs of C0, C1,
		but the input files are not 100% identical, but differ in their active flag!
		2) In addition, they do not want ADZA loaded at all in a _productive_ setup
		3) new input for many lists (users, sarea, plant, ...) with existing loaders
		4) new input file for sorg (no loader yet)
		5) updated pools for cluster 1
		6) initial data for shipping_cond (recent CR): changed again
		7) Findings from db creation tests:
		- sap_vehicle_type etc broken
		- naming errors in simple_vehicle, UQ constraints, FK naming,
Description   : -
Fix           : 1) Have plan/plant_compcode, sorg, sarea, sgroup, soffice now fully
		"per cluster" again, i.e. no longer called from initialdata_2.1_all_clusters.sql
		This also reduces number of pools/plants shown in app, etc.
		2) split companycode.csv and purchaseorg.csv, and move initialdata_ADZA into
		a seperate file (no longer call from objs.sql).
		Special: Artificial pickup vendor now need to be "per cluster" for their
		vendor_porg (because porg are no longer global)
		3) added, verified csv loaders
		4) created new loader for sorg, used by FBNL + Cluster 1 (not for ADZA/testdata yet)
		5) updated and renumbered pools. Special: no longer a "narrow gauge" pool, only 1 rail.
		6) now, instead of 04, 05, 06, 07 -> Z4, Z5, Z6, Z7
		7) fixed all
		8) added "loadtest" sql for 300 and 600 vendors.		
Workaround    : -
