ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5634
ADN Change ID : CFG282: FTP configuration for rail interface (wagon events, transportation orders)
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : No connection was possible in Holcim EBM environment
Description   : -
Fix           : Use one of the 2 proxies provided by Gabi Dencescu:
		- emea-dc1-proxy (10.16.0.10)   port 8080 for systems in DC1/Paris (IP range 10.38.0.0 - 10.38.127.254)
		- emea-dc2-proxy (10.16.128.10) port 8080 for systems in DC2/Lille (IP range 10.38.128.0 - 10.38.255.254)
		I also changed the ftp user to be the TEST user by default, EVEN for the productive setup.
		Same for config "edifact_import.remove_files" = false, always.
		Reason: We will install LP1 in december in prod environment, but
		must NOT switch to production mode before 1.1.2013, and when old
		LOGON 1.6 is shut down!
