ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2736: Sequence of item postprocessing changed, added finalInitNewOrderItems function which should be able to do alone all kind of initialization
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Autoadd material adding should be BEFORE calls using the order item list like calculateFreightCost. 

		From web order postprocessing validation errors should only be thrown from validateOrder function. Postprocessing might be called ignoring validation.
		It should be clear what is postprocessing and what is validation. Should not throw exception in postprocessOrder if not necessary.

		OrderUtils: clarified setContractDependentAttributes, and split to two functions initItemInSapContract and initItemNotInContract. They reflect
		    now if an item is based on a contract what attributes are used from the contract, and what is intentionally left empty or initialized specially.

		The new function finalInitNewOrderItems will be called from AddService handler and when intializing the new service item added manually
		on order detail - can be considered as a first step to a common function to initialized complete new order items.
