Created On    : 24-Oct-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5705
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2745: Rail tab>unloading wagon failed
Symptoms      : NPE when unloading rail wagon.
Description   : Problem was in the function that sets numerator/denumerator of an order item.
                At that point, the newly initialized order item didn't have the order field
				set yet, which was assumed to be present by the numerator/denumerator setting
				function.
Fix           : Setting the order attribute in the order item before calling the num/denom update,
                rather than afterwards.
