Created On    : 25-Oct-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5706
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2752: Order Entry: Order Creation with Material with Packaging Type S006 (Bulk dumped) fails
Symptoms      : Various errors upon the creation of an order with a material that has type S006 (bulk dumped).
Description   : In many places the code only distinguished between BULK_POWDER and BAG (and possibly service materials).
                For any other type, an exception of the style "unknown" material was thrown.
Fix           : Wherever the material type was checked for BULK_POWDER (and no explicit check was done for BULK_DUMPED),
                the code now checks for (BULK_POWDER or BULK_DUMPED). As a consequence, wherever BULK_DUMPED
				was not explicitly handled differently than BULK_POWDER, the code now behaves the same for both.
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/BestellungServiceBean.java
