Created On    : 25-Oct-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5706
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2754: Order Entry: Order Creation with Material with Packaging Type S006 (Bulk dumped) fails
Symptoms      : Nullpointer exception in this code:
<code>
return Constant.PACKAGE_TYPE_BULK_DUMPED == pkgType ||
		Constant.PACKAGE_TYPE_BULK_POWDER == pkgType;
</code>
Description   : pkgType is a Long (wrapper type); if it is null the autounboxing causes an NPE.
Fix           : This code:
<code>
return pkgType != null &&
		(Constant.PACKAGE_TYPE_BULK_DUMPED == pkgType ||
		Constant.PACKAGE_TYPE_BULK_POWDER == pkgType);
</code>
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/pdftools/layout/delnote/DeliveryNoteOrderItemLabelProvider.java

