Created On    : 25-Oct-2012 / paksyd
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5704
ADN Change ID : DISPO479: Fix for "Cannot assign External Order to Truck"
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : This bug was due to BUSINESS2714 change. 
				The Dispo.disableCamionsForDD() function is responsible for two things:
				* disabling trucks,
				* add the allowed trucks to the drag&drop targets. 
				If the dragged order was external, then this drag&drop target addition was not done.
				Therefore scheduling of external orders was not possible.
Fix           : From now on the drag&drop target addition will be done in case of external orders.
