Created On    : 26-Oct-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5721
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2770: JavaScript error when selecting material without material restrictions in order entry screen
Symptoms      : When selecting a material without default supply plant/shipping point
                in the order entry screen, a javascript error occurred.
Description   : The problem was that a selected combobox value was accessed this way:
                <code>
				editor.supplyPlantCombo.getSelectedRecord().data.plantCd
				</code>
				But getSelectedRecord() returns null if nothing is selected and an
				error occurs.
Fix           : Better to access combobox values like this:
                <code>
				editor.supplyPlantCombo.getValue()
				</code>
				This just returns null if nothing is selected.
Workaround    : Pre-set shipping point and delivery plant for the material in the dispokarte.
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/jsp/bestellung/NewOrders.jsp

