ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5706
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2777: Order Entry: (...) Delivery note issues
Symptoms      : No weights were printed on the delivery notes for a material with SAP type S006.
Description   : There was still some code in the PDF generation that only treated the package
                types "bag" and "bulk powder" explicitly; for other package types, the generation
				of the weight fields was silently skipped.
