Created On    : 31-Oct-2012 / orsika
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5656
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2793: load failed for performance orders (due to recalc) 
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : test case:
1) create new order: sum 30 tons, allowed trucks: 6t, 26t; every 4 hours, exact flags: true => 2 sdo created
2) schedule sdos on a 26t truck
3) load 1st sdo (26t)
4) load 2nd sdo: only 1t => at endload, a new sdo should be created for the rest 3t

was: (3) failed with exception
cause: in this later state of the order, when doing recalculation, custorder.todate was taken from the persisted object (from the user input, it should be null, but the system sets it calculated from the sdos todate)

Fix           : if frequency and ordered qty is not null, then todate input = null is used instead of the stored date
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/utils/CustorderUtils.java

