Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : All languages in tlgnr_sorg_tx missing except the first (en).
Description   : Reason is a wrong SQL statement in the where clause (and s.lang_cd = lang_cd,
        instead of s.lang_cd = p_lang_cd), i.e., basically 1=1 => skips all.
Fix           : Executed modified script on all DEV + TLGNEBM1+2 + also at Holcim
        LP0 in order to add all other languages.
        This only affects fbnl+cl1 initialdata. ADZA is manual SQL, and thus not
        affected. For ADZA however, 'es' was missing -> added + better values for
        better testability.
