Created On    : 31-Oct-2012 / paksyd
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-4999
ADN Change ID : DISPO483, PERSIST2002: Scheduling: Authorization for Truck Home Plant changing [LOGON-4999]
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Only allow editing the Truck Home Plant in popup if the user is authorized for this plant/shippingpoint.
				Implementation notes:
				Since DISPO481, PERSIST1994 vlgnc_dispo_truck_list view has joined shippingpoints and plants.
				The default generated authorization code added restriction for shippingpoint and plant, which could end up 
				not getting all the trucks on Scheduling screen.
				Therefore we needed to override the default generated authorization in order to do not check 
				shippingpoint and plant for the user.
				For authorizing the Home Plant changing a new view is introduced: vlgnc_dispo_home_plant, 
				which has the default authorization.
