Created On    : 31-Oct-2012 / uma
ADN Bugzilla  : -
ADN Change ID : PERSIST2004: Correct split of tlgnr_text into refdata and adza_initialdata
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Functionality broken due to missing 'fallback' values in tlgnr_text.
Description   : -
Fix           : The technically needed fallback were also contained in adza_initialdata.
		This worked in the past, when all adza data was loaded everywhere anyway.
		Since Oct 2012, when ADZA is NOT loaded in LP0/LP1/at Holcim in general,
		it has become "pure testdata".
		Therfore, all the technical motivated fallback keys must be contained
		in refdata (which is of global nature).
		Only data which has the nature of "sample" or "testdata" can remain in
		adza_initialdata.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

