Created On    : 01-Nov-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5802
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2805: Delivery Outbound not generated with service materials
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : An error occurred when generating the SAP delivery document
                for an order with a service material.
Description   : The goods movement logic tried to access the load of each order
                item to termine the storage location. But for service items, 
				there is no load, so this resulted in an error.
Fix           : Service and non-service materials are now treated differently.
                For non-service materials, the new goods movement method is
				used to determine the storage location. For service materials,
				the "standard" way is used, i.e, the storage location is determined
				from the material and the shipping point.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/SapOutgoingDataServiceBean.java

