Created On    : 02-Nov-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5519
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2806: Files Shipment and Delivery doc status Falied
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : The SAP delivery note generation failed with a runtime exception
Description   : The quantity string sent to SAP was the result of converting a
                BigInteger to a String. The BigInteger was the result of a division
				and had scale 10, therefore its string representation had 10 digits
				after the decimal points, like "23000.0000000000" and was therefore
				longer than the max. allowed 15 characters.
Fix           : Converting the scale to 4 digits after the decimal point before converting
                to String, and throwing a verbose exception if the resulting String is
				still too long.
Workaround    : -
Release Notes : -
Dependants    : -
Requires      : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/SapOutgoingDataServiceBean.java

