ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2817, COMMON762: Add validation to check if pool&carrier is set for simple vehicle order
Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Added util function to check isSimpleVehicleOrder in LogonUtil. 

		The common validation part now checks if the order's delivery type is ship or block train
		and will throw ValidationException in case pool and/or carrier is not specified -> on the UI this
		will be communicated differently:

		call center: 
		    application.errors.custordervalidation.SIMPLE_VEHICLE_ORDER_COMM_CARRIER_EMPTY
		    application.errors.custordervalidation.SIMPLE_VEHICLE_ORDER_POOL_EMPTY

		web order:
		    application.errors.custordervalidation.HIDE_REASON_CONTACT_HOLCIM

		note: this web order message should be used from now on for all common 'hide reason contact holcim' instead of
		    adding millions of new keys with the same message. (litdict is still chaotic regarding vlaidation messages).

		As validation is common for call center/web order/order detail/pickup order/lds if they happen to create such 
		a simple vehicle order all will get a validation error. (For most of them there will be no such case yet.)
