Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : CreateCustomerorder itself is now deciding if there is a need to call split functionality or not.
		Moved functionality there as in the case of ship orders the adjust times popup is not called -> no split takes place
		and therefore the persist would fail without orders. 

		SplittedOrderData.DeliveryType is intiialized in case of ship and block train as ROAD. Naming is misleading, according to
		latest news it is only used on the adjust popup. Apparently the popup does not open for ship orders, therefore seems to be not necessary.
		In the meantime the popup has to behave like in the case of ROAD if the popup opens -> ROAD is OK for now.

		This is a first version anyway.
