Created On    : 10-Nov-2012 / marius
ADN Bugzilla  : LOGON-5695
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2875: Verify, fix and test implementation of createCompletedCustomerOrder
Symptoms      : The createCompletedCustomerOrder tests failed on the newly initialized DLGNCH01 DB.
Description   : The way that the loading point was determined was not correct.
				In the createCompletedCustomerOrder case, the loading point
				must come from the "first weighing" or "second weighing"
				elements, making these in fact mandatory.
				Also, the proper way to determine the shipping point is from the order,
				which the code did not do previously. 
				Also removed the mixDesign fields from the request, since these are not
				present in a freshly set up DB and thus would break the tests in the NB.
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/in/logon_lds_interface/CreateCompletedCustomerOrderRequestHandler.java
