Cust Bug ID   : -
Platform      : -
Component     : -
Symptoms      : The Goods movement request are not sent to SAP, due to NPE.
Description   : The EJB injection is not working properly if the caller EJB references to
called EJB service by initializing a new EJB (GoodsMovementServiceBean goodsMovementService = new GoodsMovementServiceBean).
Fix           : 
1.) Add the Stateless annotation to GoodsMovementServiceBean (In order to make sure we have an Stateless bean)
2.) In the OrderServiceBean#updateOrders() service use the injected GoodsMovementServiceBean.
