Created On    : 16-Nov-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5804
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2928: Simple Vehicle: New Scheduling Screen Services
Symptoms      : Hibernate exception when accessing an entity from a JSP:
				 "ServletException in
				 'simpledispo/SimpleVehicleLoadPopupTile.jsp': failed to lazily
				 initialize a collection of role"
Description   : The OneToMany association in the view entity was not eagerly
				fetched and the business service did not explicitly call
				initialize(). Therefore the attached SimpvehLoadingpointEnitities
				were not loaded, and accessing the collection outside of the
				business layer causes this exception.
Fix           : Explicitly calling initialize() before passing the loaded
				entities back to the frontend.
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/SimpleVehicleSchedulingServiceBean.java

