Created On    : 19-Nov-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5804
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2950: Correct updating of order/assignment status after loading
Description   : Previously the status of an order was not set according to spec
				after the loading of simple vehicles. Previously, the status of _all_
				orders involved in the loading was set to "loading" if any order's
				loaded quantity was zero. However, this check needs to be done
				for each order separatly: For each order, only this orders loaded
				quantities need to be checked, and if all of these are nonzero,
				then the status of the particular order must be set to "shippign",
				and to "loaded" otherwise.
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/SimpleVehicleSchedulingServiceBean.java

