Created On    : 20-Nov-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5804
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2966: Checking composition only if a truck is present
Description   : The previous implementation of startLoad() assumed that if
				no wagon was set in the loading event, then there must be
				a truck, and tried to validate truck composition whenever
				no wagon was set.
				This proves again that assumption is the mother of all
				fuckups. Indeed, now that there are simple vehicles, there
				can be neither a wagon nor a truck set in an event.
				I made the check explicit, so that the truck composition is only
