Created On    : 20-Nov-2012 / emoke
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5935
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS2970: Conceptual change order prescheduling
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Please read the ticket description what exactly is changed, and how, it is explained detailed
		what is/was the purpose of this conceptual change.

		Summary: 
		  Until now: 
		      deallocate = set assignment to inactive if all orders are deallocated, and delete the corresponding parts
		      create assignment = cannot be present an assignment -> always creating new one
		      

		  From now:
		      deallocate = if the truck is a planning truck set the assignment status = 8 (active_flag is still true!) and
				   set the order status to transmitted to carrier ack -> worflow as-was
		      create assignment = if there is a planning assignment in the background in status 8 (prescheduling done) use that
				   assignment further, and simply use moveAssignment function which can handle the loads (deletes if not
				   yet loaded, take over new load if necessary).		    
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/in/logon_lds_interface/UpdateSchedulingRequestHandler.java
