Created On    : 21-Nov-2012 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5796
ADN Change ID : DISPO507: Simple Vehicle: New Scheduling Screen UI - Improved the Exception handling of the screen.
Component     : -
Symptoms      : * Before if any Exception was thrown in the background, it did not show up on the screen, 
				  the requsted operation was not done.
				* Unload popup did not refreshed the screen after a successful unload.
				* Loading popup did not allowed loaded quantity field values with 0.
Description   : Displaying a hyphen instead of nothing if Remark column is empty (unallocated orders sectiom).
Fix           : * From now on, if any Exception occur, the screen will display the 
				  appropriate message based on the set Reason.
				* From now on, Unload popup refreshes the screen after a successful unload.
				* From now on loading popup allows loaded quantity field values with 0.
