Created On    : 30-Nov-2012 / emoke
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5852
ADN Change ID : COMMON790, ORDER1966: Ext.ux.CheckCombobox does is not checking in case setChecked function is called - introducing initChecked function instead on Dispokarte working
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : CheckComboBox: added initChecked function. This function is behaving differently than the setValue
		  function: it will suspend the even handler on the checkbox, set the value, and resume the event handler.
		  Therefore it will NOT trigger the call otherwise triggered by the setValue function.

		
		Ext.form.Checkbox: setInitialValue function added, this was already present in the dispokarte.js exactly
		  because of the same reason why the CheckCombobox has the new initChecked function: suspend the events, set 
		  value, and resume the events.

		 dispokarte.js: instead of setChecked function call (which does not set properly the checkbox value, only
		    updates the checkboxMap structure) call initChecked which sets the value properly.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-common-web/src/main/webapp/js/logon.js
M logon-common-web/src/main/webapp/js/ext-ux/Ext.ux.CheckComboBox.js
