Created On    : 01-Dec-2012 / orsika
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5817
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3061: fix: transport duration is presented on scheduling screen also for orders created at endLoad
Component     : -
Symptoms      : if an order is created when doing the endLoad of another order, the transport duration was not filled=> diagram on scheduling screen's bottom part included only 2 parts (2 duration parts were missing)
Description   :
* cause: order template is missing where the value would be copied, as CustorderServiceBean.splitBulkCustorderEntity/2 only creates splitWrapper, but doesn't set sdoTemplate.
Although sdoTemplate is set in CustorderServiceBean.splitBulkCustorderEntity/1, that wrapper is not used anymore, but created a new one -> this wrapper creation is removed.
* trouble: setting sdoTemplate with an order's data in splitBulkCustorderEntity/2 or using the wrapper of splitBulkCustorderEntity/1 in splitBulkCustorderEntity/2 as well result in OptimisticLockException -> would need further investigation
* workaround: setting duration directly after creating a new sdo in split alg. data is coming from the first order of the customer order.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
