Created On    : 01-Dec-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6013
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3066: Correct computation of latest delivery time (LDS)
Description   : See AbstractOrderDataToCustorderRequestHandlerTest for the
				behavior of the algorithm. 
				The interesting cases are those when no latest delivery date
				is specified. Then the algorithm is:
				- Set the "latest" delivery time to the shipto's closing time
				  of the same day
				- except if the "earliest" time is past the closing time, in
				  which case set the "latest" time to the next day's closing
				  time
				- If the resulting "latest" time from the above rules falls
				  on a weekend, move it to the next working day.
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/in/logon_lds_interface/AbstractOrderDataToCustorderRequestHandler.java
A logon-business/src/test/unit/com/holcim/logon/business/services/eventbeans/in/logon_lds_interface/AbstractOrderDataToCustorderRequestHandlerTest.java

