ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3068, CUST204, ORDER1974: Additional parameter for createCustomerOrder plannedDelivery
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : If this parameter is specified it will affect the autoschedule functionality in a way that
		the order will supposed to be dispatched on the planning truck to arrive exactly at this date
		to the shipto.

		On the schedulin screen the drive-to part's end will be this date.
    
		In case the date happens to be a weekend day the date will be arranged to the latest possible
		date on friday considering the shipto's opening times, just as in the case of the delivery to
		attribute would be a weekend day.
