Created On    : 03-Dec-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5512
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3070: Merged quantity/UOM column of collective delivery note
Description   : The ticket required a space between the quantity and the UOM of the items
				in the collective delivery note. In the previous implementation, the qty
				and the UOM were put in two adjacent columns, with the quantity column
				being right aligned.
				I have changed the delivery note by merging the quantity and UOM columns into
				a single column, which contains both quantity and UOM, separated by a space.
				This is essentially how it is done in the single delivery note.
				For visual clarity, I have increased the column before the quantity/uom by
				10 units (and reduced the latter one by 10). 
