Created On    : 05-Dec-2012 / emoke
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6108
ADN Change ID : SIMUL119, TEST535: Activated CEM bag test with multiple items
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Unfortunately at the moment I could not 'refactor' the pda workflow to use for bags, as
		there are minor differences like: bulk case has only one unloadOrderItemID, but bag has multiple.
		Bulk can also have more than one, but that's the bulk tour with multi chamber truck where the structure is
		not like for the simple bag delivery: 
		    unloadOrderItem/unloadOrderItemDataField is there multiple times for simple bag with multiple items
		    unloadOrder is there multiple times, and the unloadOrderItemDataField is single for bulk tour
		
		even if they are similar their unloading process might differ. Currently listing the difference of the two cases:

		Diff 1.: waitForTourDataAndSetProperties script
		    waitForTourDataAndSetProperties step checks if the element unloadOrderItem is there multiple times and stores 
		    unloadOrderItemID2, unloadOrderItemID3...  unloadOrderItemIDn

		Diff 2: additional step which runs as startUnLoad + Delay 1 + endUnLoad as many times in the properties unloadOrderItemIDn
			is present.
  
		Diff 3: scanSilo step is disabled as in the bag case there is no silo involved

		Other than this the CEM bulk and CEM bag case is the same.

		TODO: make sure that in the properties file unloadOrderItemID2...n is NOT present otherwise the startUnLoad + endUnLoad will
		    be repeated incorrectly.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-simulator/etc/soapui/integration-tests/integration-tests-soapui-project.xml

