Created On    : 05-Dec-2012 / orsika
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5861
ADN Change ID : ORDER1987: fix: order is not droppable to a background real truck when mouse is over a planning truck
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : real trucks are present under planning trucks on the ui (covered by them).
onDragDrop callback is called by ExtJs even for the real trucks in the background (we cannot change this behaviour).
In onDragDrop (when releasing mouse button) check needed: if the truck (to drop into) is visible/ it is in the background. This is done by comparing truck coordinates and the visible div's coordinates (truck coords must be between div's coords). Dropping is done only if truck belongs to its parent div.
