Created On    : 06-Dec-2012 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5568
ADN Change ID : DISPO525: Overlapping of words in Order box when Multi-drop is done for BAGS
Component     : -
Symptoms      : The ShipTo and Material labels on a bag tour assignment was overlapped. 
				They appeared correctly with bulk tour assigments though.
Description   : The app counted the unload type assignmentparts and it used the assignmentpart 
				type code to decide if the assignmentpart is an unload part.
				For comparing it used one (1), but it is the code for the load part.
				So it ended up counting the load assignmentparts and that's why those 
				labels ended up on each other.
Fix           : Corrected the code and from now on the bag tour assignment will show 
				labels correctly (not overlappinged).
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/webapp/js/dispo2.js

