Created On    : 12-Dec-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6139
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3134: Uniformly handling UOM conversion exceptions
Description   : Introduced new Exception (LogonConversionException) that is thrown
				only from the UomConverterService, to make the catch more precise.
				Whenever such an exception is thrown, it is logged appropriately.
				If it is an ERROR (meaning the current operation cannot continue),
				then a LogonException is thrown from it.

				The structure prepares the way for the new exception to become a
				_checked_ exception one day (see LOGON-6182).
