Created On    : 13-Dec-2012 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6129
ADN Change ID : DISPO526: Truck Scheduling: Assigned external order cannot be dropped to another truck
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Moving an assignment which based on an external order from truck to truck 
				was not possible, because all the trucks was disabled.
Description   : -
Fix           : The disableCamionsForDD() function checked if the dragged order is external order, 
				but it didn't checked if the dragged object was assignment based on an external order.
				Therefore the function used all the rules to disable the trucks which are applied to LOGON orders.
				From now on it is possible to move an assigment based on external order to another truck.
Workaround    : -
