Created On    : 17-Dec-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6170
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3148: Different status update logic for simple vehicle assignments
Symptoms      : Simple vehicle assignments disappear from the scheduling screen
				after editing the assignment data.
Description   : The assignment edit popup has a logic that updates the assignment status
				based on which assignment parts already have a "real start" time set.
				This logic conflicted with the simple vehicle assignment lifecycle as
				defined in LOGON-5901.
Fix           : Implemented separate logic for simple vehicle status updates.
				Please note that nevertheless, once the real time of the
				"deliver" or "return" part is set, the assignment will
				disappear from view since it is either in status "returning" or
				"finished".
Workaround    : * always set the real start and end times of the load part,
				  never only the start time (if only the start time is set, the
				  assignment will go into status "loading")
				* don't set the real start time of a "deliver" part (otherwise
				  the assignment status will change to "unloading")
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/order/web/actions/dispo/AssignmentEditAction.java

