Created On    : 18-Dec-2012 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6197
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3150, ORDER2009: Generate both export invoice and delivery note
Symptoms      : For contracts of type ZCEX, only export invoice was created but no
				delivery note. SHOULD: Both should be printed.
Description   : Slightly refactored the delivery generation code by introducing a new
				boolean argument which determines from the "outside" whether to create
				an export invoice or a delivery note. Previously the delivery note generation
