ADN Change ID : DISPO528: Time was computed wrongly with real trucks hidden
Component     : Order/Scheduling
Symptoms      : When dragging an order onto a planning truck, then hiding the real
				trucks, and horizontally moving the order, then the order jumped
				too far left or right, outside of the delivery window.
Description   : There was a javascript bug in the code that computed the time at
				which a dragged order is. This bug applied only if the real trucks
				were hidden, because the dimensions of the "real truck" div were
				wrongly used to compute the order position.
				If the real trucks were hidden, these dimensions were no longer
				correct.
Fix           : Adapted code to always take the dimensions of the truck panel in
				which the order currently is (so either planning or real).
Workaround    : Do not hide real trucks.
