Component     : Order Detail Screen
Symptoms      : Exception when opening the "vehicle" dropdown in the expanded order
				detail filters.
Description   : The commit BUSINESS3057 introduced a casting error. It is the same
				problem that caused LOGON-6131, i.e., you can't cast an instance of
				Object[] to Foo[], where Foo is any object that directly or
				indirectly inherits from Object.
Fix           : Reverted to the old code in the affected location.
Workaround    : none known
