Created On    : 03-Jan-2013 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6227
ADN Change ID : DISPO532: Fix for error "OrderNumber is null or not an object" in Scheduling screen
Component     : -
Symptoms      : When Customer orders and External orders was visible at the same time, 
				"OrderNumber is null or not an object" error message was shown.
Description   : Manuel's investigation revealed, there was a collision of external order id's 
				and customer order id's.
				LOGON loads the Customer orders and External orders to a Map which is keyed 
				with order ID. 
Fix           : To fix this problem we negate the External order ID to create the key. 
				This way Customer orders and External orders could continue to share the same Map.
				We prefix the external order numbers with 'EXT_' in the dispo2.js to create 
				the order list.
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/order/web/ajax/DispoAjaxService.java
