Description   : There were cases where the inital data at Holcim did not have this
				flag set for FVL/bimodal shipping points, even though the code
				required it. This resulted in an NPE (the error that caused the ticket).
				After discussion (see comments in ticket) it has been decided to
				make the column not-nullable. The alternative way of treating "null"
				equivalent to "0" was deemed to confusing/too much of a hack.
