ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-5534
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3181: Correct printed quantities for bag order delivery note
Component     : Delivery note
Symptoms      : For tour bag orders with two orders of same material, the delivered and
				net quantities in the delivery node were wrong; they showed the total
				loaded quantity (sum of the orders) instead of the respective quantities
				loaded for each order.
				This happened only for the delivery note generated immediately after loading; once
				the order had status "delivered", then the delivery note was generated correctly.
Fix           : When the delivery note is generated for a bag order, and if no delivered quantity
				is yet set in the order item, then the orderItem.getLoadedQuantity() is taken rather
				than load.getNetQuantity().
