Created On    : 10-Jan-2013 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6236 
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3186: Pallet item not printed in the DN. Only 8 lines allowed.
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Longer material names would break into new row resulting some material 
				missing at the end of the table.
Description   : This new line break behavior is not LOGON specific, it is from jcan-print, 
				which we use to generate documents. The DN generation code assumes, that every 
				material occupies only one row, and sets the material table height with this 
				assumption. This results that less row could be drawn to the table, because the 
				table can only display the allowed number of rows.
				Right now the material cell could display only 28 character in one line before 
				the rest breaks to a new row.
Fix           : To fix this, the width of the material name column is increased. With this we 
				could display the 40 character long names without a missing material at the end 
				of the table. 
Workaround    : Possible workaround is to shorten the material names to 28 character.
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/pdftools/layout/delnote/DeliveryNoteMainLayout.java

