Created On    : 14-Jan-2013 / bartha
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6222
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3189: Fatal error appears when loading manually
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : The problem is vell described in "ADN Change ID" : BUSINESS2635.
				The split custorder workflow will throw the exception because the 
				hibernate flush is generating SQL INSERT commands for new entities
				which are not fully initialized (not all fields are initialized for SDOs). With 
				a workaround the new SDOs are detached from the custorder in the critical part.
				Critical part means: The SDO is not fully initialized, and there is a service call which my trigger
				hibernate flush.

				NOTE: The whole custorder creation and custorder split needs a refactoring, to remove these workarounds.
Fix           : Add a workaround (detach new SDOs in the critical part, and make it again "Persistent" )
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/CustorderServiceBean.java
M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/utils/CustorderUtils.java

