Created On    : 15-Jan-2013 / orsika
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-4739
ADN Change ID : PERSIST2158: new columns in monitoring tables
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : new columns are introduced in tlgnm_ (monitoring) tables: bizevent_id, bizevent_type_cd. bizevent_id is stored strictly as a long (in java), to avoid loading of bizevents when getting data from the monitoring table. This is a basic condition to have Live map working fast (which is the purpose of this ticket).

custom_overrides.sql puts the foreign key constraint on bizevent. It's not included in tlgnm_...xml, to avoid loading of bizevent object in java.

MonitoringTablesServiceBean sets the bizevent_id and bizevent_type_cd to the related fields, as they are mandatory fields.

Fix           : - 
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
