		- Sales Admin to have Master Data RFID Maintenance and PDA RFID-Admin as well
		- Logon Admin Lite shall not have User Admin rights automatically.
		  Give User Admin/Lite explicitely if needed by a specific Logon Admin Lite
		Simple Vehicle Admin <-> new role Simple Vehicle Scheduling?
		Situation with Simple Vehicle Admin:
		- Spec says: If a user has access to the Truck/Rail Scheduling tab in LOGON, they also have access to this one [Simple Vehicle Scheduling].
		- Spec does not mention "Simple Vehicle Admin" either, however...
		- For Road/Rail Admin: Existing role-func mappings give all respective scheduling rights also to the Road/Rail Admin
Description   : -
Fix           : LOGON-5972: Adjust initial data + patch accordingly.
		Situation with Simple Vehicle Admin:
		- Spec says: If a user has access to the Truck/Rail Scheduling tab in LOGON, they also have access to this one [Simple Vehicle Scheduling].
		- Spec does not mention "Simple Vehicle Admin" either, however...
		- For Road/Rail Admin: Existing role-func mappings give all respective scheduling rights also to the Road/Rail Admin
		Solution therefore: No new role, simply assign these 2 rights to "Simple Vehicle Admin" as well:
		- 'Simple Vehicle Dispatching R: read access' and 'Simple Vehicle Dispatching W: write access'
		
		+ Minor cleanup in db comment of tlgnc_mat_plant_tx.xml
