Created On    : 17-Jan-2013 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6314
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3196: Eliminate duplicate trucks in scheduling screen
Component     : Truck scheduling
Symptoms      : Some trucks appeared twice in the scheduling screen.
Description   : The scheduling screen code first loads all trucks for the selected
				pool and carrier. Next it loads all trucks to which one of the carrier's
				orders is assigned, but which itself belongs to another carrier
				(these are called "unathorized trucks" in the code).
				When these were loaded, the code did not properly check for duplicates.

				In order to use TruckWrappers in a HashSet, I added the equals()
				and the hashCode() method for this class, as well as a toString()
				(the latter to facilitate debugging).
Fix           : Solved by using a HashSet data structure instead of an ArrayList.
Workaround    : The only known workaround is to activate the carrier of the
				duplicate trucks in the carrier dropdown.
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/order/web/ajax/DispoAjaxService.java
