Created On    : 21-Jan-2013 / awe
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6325
ADN Change ID : PERSIST2168: view optimisation on vlgnc_dispo_assign_part_list
Component     : -
Symptoms      : scheduling screen is slow
Description   : -
Fix           : view optimisation on vlgnc_dispo_assign_part_list:
		changed sub join on order into a normal join

		note on left joins on sttx, osbp, ocbp, ccar:
		logically these are normal joins with ord, but since ord is joined with a left join
		these joins also have to be left joins
		also note that ccar should never be null for assigned orders

		on int, scheduling screen with ca. 40 orders:
		improvement (based on firefox request tracing):
		getOrderList2.dwr 1.05s -> 0.95s
		getTruckAndAssignmentList.dwr 0.7s -> 0.6s
		
		execution plan is simpler and more selective 
		("cost" on int DB with LP1 data from 4.1.2013 drops from 42000 to 1300,
		full table scans on order avoided)
		on AWR report from 17.1. (LP1) vlgnc_dispo_assign_part_list
		is in many of the slowest queries and in almost all of
		the queries with the most gets
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-persistence/etc/sql/custom_views.sql

