		select assignment_id, (comm_carrier_id|order_number), count(1) from (new|old) minus select assignment_id, (comm_carrier_id|order_number), count(1) from (old|new)
		=> no rows found => no difference between the two as far as these fields are concerned 
		(and the other potentially affected fields should all derive from these)
		changed view on int and tested with FF 6.0.2 on Linux
