ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3205: Performance fixes for order taking screen
Component     : Order taking screen
Symptoms      : Slow loading of the order taking screen for certain shiptos in production
				(up to more than 20 seconds)
Description   : This fix contains the following major changes:
				* Loading most of the ShiptoSalesAreaFinancialbackgroundData via a single view,
				  vlgns_sap_financial_data, instead of from separate tables
				* Loading the required data from tlgns_sap_material_sarea for all sareas in
				  a single query, rather than in one query per sarea
				The results are not yet breathtaking. Instead of 18 to 23 seconds, I now measured
				around 15 to 20 seconds loading for the slowest shipto CC102.
