Created On    : 24-Jan-2013 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6359
ADN Change ID : DISPO539: Ship & Block train screen - carriers cannot be selected in dropdown - only in FF 18.0.1
Component     : -
Symptoms      : Changing carrier selection does not take effect on 
				Simple Vehicle Scheduling screen.
Description   : * Background:
				The carrier selector uses a DWR call to SimpleDispoAjaxService to set the 
				selected carriers into the SimpleDispoForm. After this call the page gets 
				refreshed to be able to show all the information belonging to the selected 
				carriers. 
				* The problem:
				The page refreshing is not done in a callback on a completed DWR request, 
				but rather "on the next line" we refreshed the page. This results if the
				DWR request is not completed fast enough, the page gets refreshed _before_
				the DWR request could set the newly selected carriers into the session.
Fix           : From now on the page refreshing logic only runs if the DWR request is completed 
				(with a callback).
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/jsp/simpledispo/SimpleDispoTile.jsp

