Created On    : 24-Jan-2013 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6360
ADN Change ID : DISPO540: Fix for Truck ordering broken on Scheduling screen
Component     : -
Symptoms      : The ordering of the trucks on Scheduling screen should be:
				- carrier ascending,
				- prioirty ascending,
				- truck name ascending.
				Instead of this the trucks are not seems to be ordered.
				Changing the priority does not change the position of the truck but it should.
Description   : This bug is introduced by fixing LOGON-6314 "Road scheduling view corrupt?" 
				change ID: BUSINESS3196.
				The collection type of the trucks has changed from ArrayList to HashSet. 
				This was necessary to filter the duplicate trucks which is achieved.
				An unwanted side effect is that HashSet does not guarantee the order 
				of the items in it. This results the trucks loses the ordering.
Fix           : With using a LinkedHashSet the ordering of the trucks are not get lost 
				and performance of the collection is likely to be just slightly below 
				that of HashSet.
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-order-web/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/order/web/ajax/DispoAjaxService.java

