Created On    : 28-Jan-2013 / bartha
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6323
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3213: Some Good movements are sending to SAP two times 
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : -
Fix           : In order to make sure we not sending GMRs more than once, the GoodsMovementServiceBean#_sendSapGoodsMovement() service will use the following steps:

    			1.) Load the goods movement record from the DB (to have the fresh data)
				2.) Check the tlgnc_goods_movement.SENT_GOODSMOVE_TO_SAP_TS is null
					2.1) If is *NOT* NULL LOG a warm message and return (do nothing)
				3.) Update the tlgnc_goods_movement.SENT_GOODSMOVE_TO_SAP_TS with current timestamp and call the merge on the entity with flush.
				(NOTE: This step MUST be before the SapOutgoingDataService#sendGoodsMovement() service call,
				with this we can make sure nobody changed the entity. As if flush fails with PersistenceException, which will trigger a rollback and will return)
				4.) Call SapOutgoingDataService#sendGoodsMovement() to send the GMR to SAP. The service
				will throw an unchecked LogonException, if cannot send the GMR, which will trigger a
				rollback on the current transaction --> nothing is saved, and nothing is sent.
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
Affected Files:

M logon-business/src/main/java/com/holcim/logon/business/services/impl/GoodsMovementServiceBean.java

