Created On    : 31-Jan-2013 / bartha
ADN Ticket ID : -
ADN Change ID : COMMON824: SessionIdFilter handle the secure flag for 'JSESSIONID' cookie 
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : In production the SSL endpoint is an LB proxy, and the communication 
				between LB and LOGON is always plain HTTP (no SSL). The Secure flag is
				never attached to cookie because the current implementation sets the flag if:
				1.) the application propertie 'use_HttpOnly_Secure_SessionIdFilter' is enabled
				2.) The request is secure (request.isSecure() --> true) 
Fix           : Remove the request.isSecure() check when setting the 'Secure' flag.
