Created On    : 03-Feb-2013 / marius
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6419
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3223: Properly loading payer list for order entry screen
Component     : Order taking screen
Symptoms      : The payers were not displayed correctly.
Description   : There were two bugs introduced with LOGON-6300 (commit BUSINESS3205):
				1) The billto partner functions were used to load the payer BPs instead,
			       but the code anyway checked for the payer flag on the BPs. Therefore
				   some soldto's didn't have any selectable payers at all -> order creation
				   impossible.
				2) The view loading the payer/soldto/billto etc data lacked a composite key.
				   The result was that if there were multiple payers in SAP, only one of them
				   would be shown.
Fix           : Added a composite key for the view, and using the correct list of IDs
				to load the payer BPs.
Workaround    : none found
