Created On    : 07-Feb-2013 / paksyd
ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6449
ADN Change ID : DISPO548: Combined correctAssignmentPartDistance() and correctAssignmentPartDuration()
Component     : -
Symptoms      : -
Description   : Calling DispoAjaxService.correctAssignmentPartDistance() and 
				DispoAjaxService.correctAssignmentPartDuration() per assignment parts 
				could cause performance issues in browsers with high assignemnt count.

				These DWR methods are always called together so it makes sense to combine
				them in a single one, thus sparing one request per assignment part.
Fix           : -
Workaround    : -
Pkg Changes   : -
