ADN Ticket ID : LOGON-6123
ADN Change ID : BUSINESS3233, COMMON828, ORDER2046: fix for shipping point drowdown refresh
Component     : -
Symptoms      : order details screen: when choosing another delivery plant, shipping point dropdown should be updated according to that. but it remains unchanged
Description   : plantCd contains the new code of the new plant, but it is not used to calculate the new list of the shipping points, but the shipping points are got from the bean
Fix           : list of shipping points are calculated with the same conditions as on order taking screen:
shipping point entities 
- belonging to that plantCd, 
- with active flag = true, 
- delivery type of the sp matches the delivery type of the order

